hadiths[262]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3057","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sahaba ko khitab farmaya, aap ne Allah Taala ki sana bayan ki, jo uski shaan ke laaiq thi. phir dajjal ka zikr farmaya, aur farmaya ke main bhi tumhen iske (fitnon se) daraataa hun, koi Nabi aisa nahi guzra jisne apni qaum ko uske fitnon se na daraayaa ho, Nuh (Alaihissalam) ne bhi apni qaum ko us se daraayaa tha lekin main iske barey main tum se aik aisi baat kahunga jo kisi Nabi ne apni qaum se nahi kahi , aur wo baat ye hai ke dajjal kaana hoga aur Allah Taala us se paak hai."
"3058","maine Hijjatul-wada ke mauqe par arz kya, ya Rasulullah ! kal aap (Makka mein) kahan qiyam farmaaengey ? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ! Aqeel ne hamarey liye koi ghar chhoda hi Kab hai. phir farmaya ke kal hamara qiyam Hanif bin kinaana ke maqam Muhassab mein hoga, jahan par Quraish ne kufr par qism khaaii thi. waqia ye hua tha ke bani kinaana aur Quraish ne ( yahin par) bani Hashim ke khilaf is baat ki qismein khaaii thin ke unse khareed w farokht ki jaey aur na unhein apne gharon mein aaney dein. Zohri ne kaha ke khaif wadi ko kehtey hain."
"3059","umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne hanii naam ke apne aik ghulam ko (sarkaarii) charaagaah ka Hakim banaya, to unhein ye hidayat ki, aey hanii ! musalmanon se apne hath rokey rakhna (un par zulm na karnaa) aur mazloom ki baddua se har waqt bachtey rehna, kyonke mazloom ki dua qabool hoti hai. aur haan ibne- Auf aur ibne- Affaan aur un jaisey ( ameer sahaba (ke maweshiyon ke barey mein tujhey dartey rehna chahiye (yani unke ameer honey ki wjah se doosrey ghareebon ke maweshiyon par charaagaah mein unhein muqaddam na rakhna ( kyonke agar unke maweshii halaak bhi ho jaeinge to ye ruoosaa apne khajoor ke baghaat aur kheton se apna chaaraa hasil kar saktey hain. lekin giney-chuney oonton aur ginii-chunii bakriyon ka Malik ( ghareeb (ke agar iske maweshii halaak ho gaey, to wo apne bachchon ko lekar mere paas aayega , aur faryaad karega : ya ameerul-momineen! ya ameerul-momineen! to kya main unhein chhod doonga (yani unko paalnaa ( tumhara bap na ho? isliye (pahley hi se) unke liye chaarey aur pani ka intizam kar dena mere liye us se zyada aasan hai ke main unke liye soney chandi ka intizam karun aur Allah ki qasam! wo (ahal Madeena) ye samajhtey hongey ke maine unke sath zyadti ki hai kyonke ye zameenein unhiin ki hain. unhon-ne jahiliyat ke zamane mein uske liye ladaaiyaan ladiin hain aur Islam laney ke baad bhi unki milkiyat ko bahaal rakha gaya hai. us zaat ki qasam! jiske hath mein meri jaan hai agar wo amwaal (ghodey wghaira) na hotey jin par jihad mein logon ko sawar karta hun to unke ilaaqon mein aik baalisht zameen ko bhi mein charaagaah na banaataa."
"3060","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo log Islam ka kalima padh chukey hain unke naam likh kar mere paas laao. '' chunanche ham ne dedh hazaar mardon ke naam likh kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein pesh kiye aur ham ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se arz kya hamari tadaad dedh hazaar ho gaee hai. ab ham ko kya dar hai. lekin tum dekh rahe ho ke (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baad) ham fitnon mein is tarah ghir gaey ke ab musalman tanha Namaz padhtey huey bhi darney laga hai. ham se abdaan ne bayan kya, unse abu-Hamza ne aur unse Aamash ne ( uper zikr ki gaee sanad ke saath) ke ham ne panch so musalmanon ki tadaad likhi (hazaar ka zikr is riwayat mein nahi hua) aur abu-Muawia ne (apni riwayat mein) yun bayan kya, ke chh so se saat so tak."
"3061","aik shakhs Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur arz kya ya Rasulullah ! mera naam falan jihad mein janey ke liye likha gaya hai. idhar meri biwi Haj karne ja rahi hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir ja aur apni biwi ke sath Haj kar aa."
"3062","ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aik jang mein maujood they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik shakhs ke mutaalliq jo apne ko musalman kehta tha, farmaya ke ye shakhs dozakh walon mein se hai. jab jang shuru hui to wo shakhs (musalmanon ki taraf) badi bahaadurii ke sath lada aur wo zakhmi bhi ho gaya. sahaba ne arz kya, ya Rasulullah ! jiske mutaalliq aap ne farmaya tha ke wo dozakh mein jaeyga aaj to wo badi be-jigrii ke sath lada hai aur (zakhmii ho kar) mar bhi gaya hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ab bhi wahi jawab diya ke jahannam mein gaya. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya, ke mumkin tha ke kuchh logon ke dil mein kuchh shuba paida ho jata. lekin abhi log usi ghaur w fikr mein they ke kisi ne bataya ke abhi wo maraa nahi hai. albatta zakhm kaarii hai. phir jab raat aai to usne zakhmon ki taab na la kar khudkushii kar li. jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko uski khabar di gaee to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allaahu-akbar! mein gawahi deta hun ke main Allah ka banda aur uska rasool hun. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ko hukm diya, aur unhon-ne logon mein elaan kar diya ke musalman ke siwa jannat mein koi aur dakhil nahi hoga aur Allah Taala kabhi apne Deen ki imdaad kisi faajir shakhs se bhi kara leta hai."
"3063","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (Madina mein) Mautaa ki jang ke mauqe par khutba diya, (jab ke musalman sipaahii mautaa ke maidan mein bahaadurii dikhaa rahe they) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ab Islami jhanda Zaid-bin-Haarisa ne sanbhaalaa aur unhein Shahid kar diya gaya, phir Jafar ne jhanda apne hath mein utha liya aur wo bhi Shahid kar diye gaey. ab Abdullaah-bin-Rawaaha ne jhanda thaamaa , ye bhi Shahid kar diye gaey. aakhir Khalid-bin Waleed ne kisi nai hidayat ke baghair Islami jhanda utha liya hai. aur unke hath par fateh hasil ho gaee, aur mere liye ismein koi khushi ki baat nahi thi ya Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, ke unke liye koi khushi ki baat nahi thi ke wo (shohdaa) hamarey paas zinda hotey. (kyonke shahadat ke baad wo jannat mein aish kar rahe hain) aur Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke us waqt Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aankhon se aansu jari they."
"3064","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein Ra-al, Zakwaan, Usba aur banu-Lahyaan qabaayel ke kuchh log aaey aur yaqin dilaya ke wo log Islam la chukey hain aur unhon-ne apni kaafir qaum ke muqabil imdaad aur taleem w tableegh ke liye aap se madad chaahi. to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne 70 ansaariyon ko unke sath kar diya. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya, ke ham unhein qaari kaha kartey they. wo log din mein jangal se lakdiyan jama kartey aur raat mein Namaz padhtey rehtey. ye hazraat un qabeele walon ke sath chaley gaey, lekin jab Maoona kunwey par pahunchey to unhein qabila walon ne un sahaba ke sath daghaa ki aur unhein Shahid kar dala. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik mahina tak (namaz mein) qunoot padhi aur Ra'l w Zakwan aur banu- Lahyaan ke liye baddua kartey rahe. Qatada ne kaha ke ham se Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke (un shohdaa ke barey mein) Quran Majeed mein ham ye aayat yun padhtey rahe ''haan! hamari qaum ( muslim) ko bata do ke ham apne rab se ja miley aur wo ham se razi ho gaya hai aur hamein bhi us ne khush kya hai.'' phir ye aayat mansukh ho gaee thi."
"3065","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko jab kisi qaum par fateh hasil hoti, to maidaane-jang mein teen raat qiyam farmatey. Rooh-bin-Ubaada ke sath us hadis ko Muaz aur Abdul-Aala ne bhi riwayat kya. donon ne kaha ham se Saeed ne bayan kya unhon-ne Qatada se, unhon-ne Anas se, unhon-ne abu-Talha se unhon-ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se."
"3066","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne maqam Jaarana se, jahan Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jange-Hunain ka maale-ghanimat taqseem kya tha, Umre ka ehram baandha tha."
"3067","unka aik ghoda bhag gaya tha aur dushmanon ne usko pakad liya tha. phir musalmanon ko ghalba hasil hua to unka ghoda unhein wapas kar diya gaya. ye waqia Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ahade-mubaarak ka hai. isi tarah unke aik ghulam ne bhag kar Rome (mojooda Itly) mein panah hasil kar li thi. phir jab musalmanon ko us mulk par ghalba hasil hua to Khaalid-bin-Waleed (Raziallahu anhu) ne unka ghulam unhein wapas kar diya. ye waqia Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baad ka hai."
"3068","ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ka aik ghulam bhag kar Rome (mojooda Itly) ke kaafiron mein mil gaya tha. phir Khalid-bin Waleed (Raziallahu anhu) ki sarkardagi mein (Islaamii lashkar ne) is par fateh paai aur Khalid (Raziallahu anhu) ne wo ghulam unko wapas kar diya aur ye ke Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ka aik ghoda bhag kar Rome (mojooda Itly) pahunch gaya tha. Khalid-bin Waleed (Raziallahu anhu) ko jab Rome (mojooda Itly) par fateh hui, to unhon-ne ye ghoda bhi Abdullah ko wapas kar diya tha."
"3069","jis din Islami lashkar ki mudbhed ( roomiyon se) hui to wo aik ghodey par Sawar they. saalaar fauj Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf se Khalid-bin Waleed (Raziallahu anhu) they. phir ghodey ko dushmanon ne pakad liya, lekin jab unhein shikast hui to Khalid (Raziallahu anhu) ne ghoda Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ko wapas kar diya."
"3070","maine ( jange-khandaq mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bhookaa pa kar chupkey se) arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! ham ne aik chhota sa bakri ka bachcha zabah kya hai. aur aik saa jo ka aata pakwaayaa hai. isliye aap 2 char aadmiyon ko sath lekar tashrif laaein. lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne baa-aawaaz buland farmaya ''aey khandaq khodney waalo! Jaabir ne dawat ka khana taiyaar kar liya hai. aao chalo, jaldi chalo.''"
"3071","main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat main apne walid ke sath hazir hui, mein us waqt aik zard rang ki qamees pahney huey thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ''san-san'' Abdullah ne kaha ye lafz habshi zaban mein umda ke matlab mein bola jata hai. unhon-ne bayan kya ke phir main mohare-nubuwat ke sath (jo aap ke pusht par thi) khelney lagi to mere walid ne mujhey daantaa, lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey mat daanto, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne umme-Khalid ko (lambii umr ki) dua di ke us qamees ko khub pahan aur puraanii kar, phir pahan aur puraanii kar, aur phir pahan aur puraanii kar, Abdullah ne kaha ke chunanche ye qamees itney dinon tak baqi rahi ke zabanon par iska charcha aa gaya."
"3072","Hasan-bin-Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne sadqa ki khajoor mein se (jo baitul-maal mein aai thi) aik khajoor utha li aur apne munh ke qareeb ley gaey. lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein Farsi zaban ka ye lafz keh kar rok diya ke) كخ كخ ( kya tumhen malum nahi ke ham sadqa nahi khaya kartey hain."
"3073","mujh se Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein Khattab farmaya aur khayanat ka zikr farmaya, us jurm ki holnaakii ko waazeh kartey huey farmaya ke main tum mein kisi ko bhi qiyamat ke din us haalat mein na paon ke uski gardan par bakri ladi hui ho aur wo chilla rahi ho ya uski gardan par ghoda lada hua ho aur wo chilla raha ho aur wo shakhs mujh se kahey ke ya Rasulullah ! meri madad farmaiye. lekin main ye jawab de dun ke main tumhari koi madad nahi kar sakta. main to ( Allah ka paigham ( tum tak pahuncha chuka tha aur uski gardan par oont lada hua ho aur chilla raha ho aur wo shakhs kahey ke ya Rasulullah ! meri madad farmaiye . lekin main ye jawab de dun ke main tumhari koi madad nahi kar sakta, main Allah ka paigham tumhen pahuncha chuka tha, ya (wo us haal mein aaey ke) wo apni gardan par sona , chandi , asbaab laadey huey ho aur wo mujh se kahey ke ya Rasulullah! meri madad farmaiye, lekin main us se ye keh dun ke main tumhari koi madad nahi kar sakta, main Allah Taala ka paigham tumhen pahuncha chuka tha. ya uski gardan par kapdey ke tukdey hon jo usey harkat de rahe hon aur wo kahey ke ya Rasulullah! meri madad kijiye aur main keh dun ke main tumhari koi madad nahi kar sakta, main to (Allah ka paighaam) pahley hi pahuncha chuka tha aur Ayub sakhtiyan ne bhi abu-Hayyan se riwayat kya hai ghoda laadey dekhun jo hinhinaa raha ho."
"3074","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke saman w asbaab par aik sahib muqarrar they, jinka naam kar-kara tha. unka intiqal ho gaya, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo to jahannam mein gaya. sahaba unhein dekhney gaey to aik chadar jisey khayanat karke unhon-ne chipa liya tha unke yahan mili . abu-Adbullah (Imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ( ne kaha ke Muhammad-bin salam ne ( ibne-Uena se naql kya aur) kaha ye lafz karkara hi likha hua hai."
"3075","maqam zul-Hulaifa mein ham ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath padao kya. log bhookey they. idhar ghaneemat mein hamein oont aur bakriyan mili thin. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) lashkar ke peechhey hissey mein they. logon ne (bhook ke maarey) jaldi ki haandiyaan chadhaa din. baad mein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hukm se un haandiyon ko aundha diya gaya phir aap ne ghaneemat ki taqseem shuru ki das bakriyon ko aik oont ke barabar rakha ittifaq se maale-ghanimat ka aik oont bhag niklaa. lashkar mein ghodon ki kami thi. log usey pakadney ke liye daudey lekin oont ne sab ko thakaa diya. aakhir aik sahabi (khud Raafe (Raziallahu anhu)) ne usey teer maaraa. Allah Taala ke hukm se oont jahan tha wahin reh gaya. is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke un ( paaltu ( janwaron mein bhi janglii janwaron ki tarah kuchh baar wahshat ho jati hai. isliye agar unmein se koi qaabu mein na aaey to iske sath aisa hi karo. abaaya kehtey hain ke mere dada ( Raafe (Raziallahu anhu)) ne khidmat nabwi mein arz kya, ke hamein ummeed hai ya (ye kaha ke) khof hai ke kal kahin hamari dushman se mudbhed na ho jaey. idhar hamarey paas chhuri nahi hai. to kya ham baans ki khapchiyon se zabah kar saktey hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo cheez khoon baha de aur zabah kartey waqt is par Allah Taala ka naam bhi liya gaya ho, to uska gosht khana halal hai. albatta wo cheez (jis se zabah kya gaya ho) daant aur naakhun na hona chahiye tumharey samney mein uski wjah bhi bayan karta hun daant to isliye nahi ke wo haddi hai aur naakhun isliye nahi ke wo habshiyon ki chhuri hain."
"3076","mujh se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''zil-khalsaa (Yaman ke Kabey ( ko tabah karke mujhey kyon khush nahi kartey. ''ye zil-khalsaa( Yaman ke qabila ( Khasam ka but kada tha ( Kabey ke muqabil banaya tha) jisey Kaba al-yamaaniya kehtey they. chunanche main (apne qabeela) Ahmas ke dedh so sawaaron ko lekar taiyaar ho gaya. ye sab achchhey shehsawaar they. phir maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se arz kya ke main ghodey par achi tarah se jam nahi paata to aap ne mere seeney par hath maara aur maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ungliyon ka nishan apne seeney par dekha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phir ye dua dii ( اللهم ثبته واجعله هاديا مهديا Mina padhi. . Mina فانطلق إليها فكسرها وحرقها )''aey Allah ! usey ghodey par jama de aur usey sahi rasta dikhaaney wala bana de aur khud usey bhi raah paya hua kar de. '' phir Jarir (Raziallahu anhu) muhim par rawaana huey aur zil-khalsa ko tod kar jalaa diya iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein khushkhabri bhijwaai Jarir (Raziallahu anhu) ke qaasid ( Husain bin Rabee ( ne (khidmat nabwi mein) hazir ho kar arz kya ya Rasulullah! us zaat paak ki qism jisne aapko sachcha paighambar bana kar maboos farmaya main us waqt tak aap ki khidmat mein hazir nahi hua jab tak wo but kada jal kar aisa ( siyah ( nahi ho gaya jaisa khaarish wala bimar oont siyah hua karta hai. ye sun kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qabila Ahmas ke sawaaron aur unke paidal jawaanon ke liye panch martaba barkat ki dua farmai Musaddad ne us hadis mein yun kaha zil-khalsaa Khasam qabeeley mein aik ghar tha."
"3077","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne fateh Makka ke din farmaya ''ab hijrat (Makka se Madina ke liye) baqi nahi rahi , albatta Husne-niiyat aur jihad baqi hai. isliye jab tumhen jihad ke liye bulaya jaey to fauran nikal jaao.''"
"3078","majaashea' apne bhai majaalid bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ko lekar khidmat nabwi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mein hazir huey aur arz kya ke ye majaalid hain. aap se hijrat par bait karna chahtey hain. lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke fateh Makka ke baad ab hijrat baqi nahi rahi. haan main Islam par unse bait ley loonga."
"3079","majaashea' apne bhai majaalid bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ko lekar khidmat nabwi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mein hazir huey aur arz kya ke ye majaalid hain. aap se hijrat par bait karna chahtey hain. lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke fateh Makka ke baad ab hijrat baqi nahi rahi. haan main Islam par unse bait ley loonga."
"3080","mein Ubaid-bin-Umair ke sath Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki khidmat mein hazir hua. us waqt aap Sabeer pahaad ke qareeb qiyam farma thin. aap ne ham se farmaya ke jab Allah Taala ne apne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Makka par fateh di thi, usi waqt se hijrat ka silsile khatm ho gaya tha (Sabeer mashhoor pahaad hai)."
"3081","main achi tarah janta hun ke tumharey sahib ( Ali (Raziallahu anhu)) ko kis cheez se khoon bahaney par jur'at hui, maine khud unse suna, wo bayan kartey they ke mujhey aur Zubair-bin-Awaam (Raziallahu anhu) ko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bheja aur hidayat farmai ke rauza khaakh par jab tum pahuncho , to unhein aik aurat ( saara naam ke) milegii. jisey Haatib ibne- Balta' (Raziallahu anhu) ne aik khat de kar bheja hai (tum wo khat us se lekar aao ( chunanche jab ham us baagh tak pahunchey ham ne us aurat se kaha khat la . usne kaha ke Haatib (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujhey koi khat nahi diya. ham ne us se kaha ke khat khud b-khud nikal kar dedey warna ( talashi ke liye) tumharey kapdey utaar liye jaengey. tab kahin us ne khat apne nefey mein se nikal kar diya. (jab ham ne wo khat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein pesh kya, to (aap ne Haatib (Raziallahu anhu) ko bula bheja unhon-ne ( hazir ho kar) arz kya. ya Rasulullah ! mere barey mein jaldi na farmaein ! Allah ki qism ! maine na kufr kya hai aur na main Islam se hata hun, sirf apne khandan ki mohabbat ne is par majbur kya tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ashaab ( muhajireen ( mein koi shakhs aisa nahi jiske rishtedar wghaira Makka mein na hun. jinke zariey Allah Taala unke khandan walon aur unki jaaidaad ki hifazat na karaataa ho. lekin mera wahan koi bhi aadmi nahi, isliye maine chaha ke un Makka walon par aik ehsan kar dun, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bhi unki baat ki tasdeeq farmai. umr (Raziallahu anhu) farmaney lagey mujhey iska sar utaarney dijiye ye to munafiq ho gaya hai. lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tumhen kya ma'loom! Allah Taala ahale-badr ke halaat se khub waaqif tha aur wo khud ahal badr ke barey mein farma chuka hai ke ''jo chaho karo. abu-Abdur-Rehman ne kaha, Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ko usi irshad ne (ke tum jo chaho karo, khoon-rezii par) dilair bana diya hai."
"3082","Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) ne Abdullah-bin Jafar (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha, tumhen wo qissa yad hai jab main aur tum aur Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) teenon aagey ja kar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se miley they (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jihad se wapas aa rahe they) Abdullah-bin Jafar ne kaha, haan yad hai. aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh ko aur Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ko apne sath sawar kar liya tha, aur tumhen chhod diya tha."
"3083","Saaib-bin-Yazeed (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, (jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jange-Tabook se wapas tashrif la rahe they, to ( ham sab bachchey saniiyatul-wadaa' tak Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka istiqbaal karne gaey they."
"3084","jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (jihad se) wapas hotey to teen baar Allahu-akbar kehtey, aur ye dua padhtey آيبون إن شاء الله تائبون عابدون حامدون لربنا ساجدون ، Mina صدق الله وعده ، Mina ونصر عبده ، Mina وهزم الأحزاب وحده''insha'allah ham Allah ki taraf lotney waley hain. ham tauba karne waley hain. apne rab ki ibadat karne waley hain. uski tareef karne waley aur uske liye sajda karne waley hain. Allah ne apna wada sachcha kar dikhaayaa, apne bandey ki madad ki, aur kaafiron ke lashkar ko usi akeley ne shikast de dii.''"
"3085","Asfan se wapas hotey huey ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they. aap apni ontni par Sawar they aur aap ne sawari par peechhey ( Ummul-Momenin ( Safiya-binte-Huyi (Raziallahu anhu) ko bithaya tha. ittifaq se aap ki ontni phisal gaee aur aap donon gir gaey. ye haal dekh kar abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) bhi fauran apni sawari se kood padey aur kaha, ya Rasulullah ! Allah mujhey aap par qurbaan karey, kuchh chot to nahi lagi ? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ''pahley aurat ki khabar lo.'' abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne aik kapda apne chehrey par daal liya, phir Safiya (Raziallahu anhu) ke qareeb aaey aur wahi kapda unke uper daal diya. iske baad donon ki sawari durust ki, jab aap Sawar ho gaey to ham Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke charon taraf jama ho gaey. phir jab Madina dikhai dene laga to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye dua padhii آيبون تائبون عابدون لربنا حامدون‏''ham Allah ki taraf wapas hone-waale hain. tauba karne waale, apne rab ki ibadat karne waley aur uski hamd padhney waley hain.'' Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ye dua barabar padhtey rahe yahan tak ke Madina mein dakhil ho gaey."
"3086","wo aur abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they, Ummul-Momenin Safiya (Raziallahu anhu) ko Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni sawari par peechhey bitha rakha tha. rastey mein ittifaq se aap ki ontni phisal gaee aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) gir gaey aur Ummul-Momenin bhi gir gaiin. abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne yun kaha ke main samajhta hun, unhon-ne apne aapko oont se gira diya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke qareeb pahunch kar arz kya : aey Allah ke rasool! Allah mujhey aap par qurbaan karey koi chot to aapko nahi aai ? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi lekin tum aurat ki khabar lo. chunanche unhon-ne aik kapda apne chehrey par daal liya, phir Ummul-Momenin ki taraf badhey aur wahi kapda un par daal diya. ab Ummul-Momenin khadi ho gain . phir abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne aap donon ke liye ontni ko mazbut kya. to aap sawar huey aur safar shuru kya. jab Madina Munawra ke samney pahunch gaey ya rawi ne ye kaha ke jab Madina dikhai dene laga to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye dua padhii آيبون تائبون عابدون لربنا حامدون‏''ham Allah ki taraf lotney waley hain. tauba karne waale, apne rab ki ibadat karne waley aur uski tareef karne waley hain ! '' Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ye dua barabar padhtey rahe, yahan tak ki Madina mein dakhil ho gaey."
"3087","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aik safar mein tha. jab ham Madina pahunchey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke pahley masjid mein ja aur 2 rakaat ( nafl ( Namaz padh ."
"3088","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab din chadhey safar se wapas hotey to baithney se pahley masjid mein ja kar do rakaat nafl Namaz padhtey they."
"3089","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Madina tashrif laey (jange-Tabook ya zaatur-Riqaa' se) to oont ya gaaey zabah ki) rawi ko shuba hai) Muaz Anbari ne (apni riwayat mein) kuchh zyadti ke sath kaha, unse Shoba ne bayan kya, unse Mahaarib-bin-Dassaar ne, unhon-ne Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se suna ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se oont khareedaa tha. 2 auqiya aur aik dirham ya ( rawi ko shuba hai ke 2 auqiya ( 2 dirham mein. jab aap maqam Saraar par pahunchey to aap ne hukm diya aur gaaey zabah ki gaee aur logon ne iska gosht khaayaa. phir jab aap Madina Munawra pahunchey to mujhey hukm diya ke pahley masjid mein ja kar do rakaat Namaz padhun , iske baad mujhey mere oont ki qeemat wazan karke inayat farmai."
"3090","main safar se wapas Madina pahuncha to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey hukm diya ke masjid mein ja kar do rakaat nafl Namaz padhun, saraar (Madina Munawra se teen mail ke faasley par mashriq mein) aik jagah ka naam hai."
"3091","Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya, jange-badr ke maale-ghanimat se mere hissey mein aik jawan ontni aai thi aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bhi aik jawan ontni khums ke maal mein se di thi, jab mera irada hua ke Fatima (Raziallahu anha) binte-rasoolullaah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se shadi karun to bani qainuqaa' ( qabila yahood (ke aik sahib se jo sunaar they, maine ye tay kya ke wo mere sath chaley aur ham donon izkhir ghaas (jangal se) laaein. mera irada ye tha ke main wo ghaas sunaaron ko beech doonga aur uski qeemat se apne nikah ka walima karunga. abhi main un donon oontniyon ka saamaan, paalaan aur thailey aur rassiyaan jama kar raha tha aur ye donon oontniyan aik Ansari sahabi ke ghar ke paas baithi hui thin ke jab Sara saman faraaham karke wapas aaya to kya dekhta hun ke meri donon oontniyon ke kohan kisi ne kaat diye hain. aur unke pet cheer kar andar se kalejii nikal li gaee hain. jab maine ye haal dekha to main be ikhtiyar ro diya. maine puchha ke ye sab kuchh kis ne kya hai? to logon ne bataya ke Hamza-bin-abdul-Muttalib (Raziallahu anhu) ne aur wo usi ghar mein kuchh Ansar ke sath sharab pi rahe hain. main wahan se wapas aa gaya aur seedha Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua. aap ki khidmat mein us waqt Zaid-bin-Haarisa (Raziallahu anhu) bhi baithey huey they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mujhey dekhtey hi samajh gaey ke main kisi badey sadmey mein hun. isliye Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya : ''Ali! kya hua?'' maine arz kya ya Rasulullah! maine aaj ke din jaisa sadma kabhi nahi dekha. Hamza (Raziallahu anhu) ne meri donon oontniyon par zulm kar diya. donon ke kohan kaat daley aur unke pet cheer daley. abhi wo usi ghar mein kai yaaron ke sath sharab ki majlis jamaaey huey maujood hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye sun kar apni chadar mangi aur usey odh kar paidal chalney lagey. main aur Zaid-bin-Haarisa (Raziallahu anhu) bhi aap ke peechhey-peechhey huey. aakhir jab wo ghar aa gaya jis mein Hamza (Raziallahu anhu) maujood they, to aap ne andar aaney ki ijazat chahi aur andar maujood logon ne aapko ijazat de di. wo log sharab pi rahe they. Hamza (Raziallahu anhu) ne jo kuchh kya tha. is par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein kuchh malaamat karna shuru ki. Hamza (Raziallahu anhu) ki aankhen sharab ke nashey mein makhmoor aur surkh ho rahi thin. unhon-ne nazar utha kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha. phir nazar zara aur uper uthaaii, phir wo Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ghutnon par nazar le gaey iske baad nigaah aur utha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki naaf ke qareeb dekhney lagey. phir chehrey par jama di. phir kehney lagey ke tum sab mere bap ke ghulam ho, ye haal dekh kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jab mehsus kya ke Hamza bilkul nashey mein hain, to aap wahin se ultey paon wapas aagey aur ham bhi aap ke sath nikal aaey."
"3092","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sahibzadi Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat ke baad Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) se mutalba kya tha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke us tarka se unhein unki meeraas ka hissa dilaya jaey jo Allah Taala ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Faiy ki sura mein diya tha (jaisey fidak wghaira)."
"3093","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (apni hayaat mein) farmaya tha ke hamara (garoh anbiya (Alaihissalam) ka ( wirsa taqseem nahi hota, hamara tarka sadqa hai. Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ye sun kar ghussa ho gain aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se tarake-mulaaqaat ki aur wafat tak unse na milein. wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baad chh mahiney zinda rahi thin. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ke Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke khaibar aur fidak aur Madina ke sadqey ki wiraasat ka mutalba Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) se kya tha Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ko us se inkar tha. unhon-ne kaha ke main kisi bhi aisey amal ko nahi chhod sakta jisey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni zindagi mein kartey rahe they. (Aaisha (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke) phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka Madina ka jo sadqa tha wo umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne Ali aur Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ko (apne daure-khilaafat mein) de diya. albatta khaibar aur fidak ki jaaidaad ko umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne rok rakha aur farmaya ke ye donon Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka sadqa hain aur un huquq ke liye jo waqti taur par pesh aatey ya waqti haadsaat ke liye rakhi thin. ye jaaidaad us shakhs ke ikhtiyar mein rahengii jo khaleefae-waqt ho. Zohri ne kaha, chunanche un donon jaaydaadon ka intizam aaj tak (bazariey hukoomat) isi tarah hota chala aata hai."
"3094","(Zohri ne bayan kya ke) Muhammad-bin-Jubair ne mujh se (usi aaney waali) hadis ka zikr kya tha. isliye maine Maalik-bin-Aos ki khidmat mein khud hazir ho kar unse us hadis ke mutaalliq (bataur tasdeeq) poochha. unhon-ne kaha ke din chadh aaya tha aur main apne ghar walon ke sath betha hua tha, itney mein Umar-bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ka aik bulaney wala mere paas aaya aur kaha ke ameerul-momineen aapko bula rahe hain. main us qaasid ke sath hi chala gaya aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein hazir hua. aap aik takht par boriyaa bichhaaey, boriye par koi bichhonaa na tha, sirf aik chamdey ke takiye par tek lagaey huey they. main salam karke baith gaya. phir unhon-ne farmaya, Maalik! tumhari qaum ke kuchh log mere paas aaey they, maine unke liye kuchh haqeer si imdaad ka faisla kar liya hai. tum usey apni nigrani mein unmein taqseem kara do, maine arz kya, ya ameerul-momineen! agar aap us kaam par kisi aur ko muqarrar farma detey to behtar hota. lekin umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne yahi israar kya ke nahi, apni hi tahweel mein baant do. abhi main wahin hazir tha ke ameerul-momineen ke darbaan Yarfaa aaey aur kaha ke Usmaan-bin-Affaan, Abdur-Rehmaan-bin-Auf, Zubair-bin-Awaam aur Sad-bin-abi-Waqas (Raziallahu anhu) andar aaney ki ijazat chahtey hain? umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke haan, unhein andar bila lo. aap ki ijazat par ye hazraat dakhil huey aur salam karke baith gaey. Yarfaa bhi thodi der baithey rahe aur phir andar aa kar arz kya Ali aur Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ko bhi andar aaney ki ijazat hai? aap ne farmaya ke haan, unhein bhi andar bula lo. aap ki ijazat par ye hazraat bhi andar tashrif ley aaey aur salam karke baith gaey. Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, ya ameerul-momineen! mera aur unka faisla kar dijiye. un hazraat ka jhagdaa us jaaidaad ke barey mein tha jo Allah Taala ne apne rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bani Nazir ke amwaal mein se (khums ke taur par) inayat farmai thi. is par Usman aur unke sath jo doosrey sahaba they kehney lagey, haan, ameerul-momineen! un hazraat mein faisla farma dijiye aur har aik ko doosrey ki taraf se be-fikr kar dijiye. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, achchha, to phir zara thahariye aur dam ley lijiye mein aap logon se us Allah ki qism de kar poochhta hun jiske hukm se aasman aur zameen qaaim hain. kya aap logon ko malum hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke ''ham paighambaron ka koi waaris nahi hota, jo kuchh ham ( anbiya ( chhod kar jatey hain wo sadqa hota hai.''jis se Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki murad khud apni zaate-giraamii bhi thi. un hazraat ne tasdeeq ki, ke ji haan, beshak Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye farmaya tha. ab umr (Raziallahu anhu) , Ali aur Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf mukhaatab huey, unse poochha. main aap hazraat ko Allah ki qism deta hun, kya aap hazraat ko bhi malum hai ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aisa farmaya hai ya nahi? unhon-ne bhi uski tasdeeq ki ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne beshak aisa farmaya hai. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ab main aap logon se us mamla ki sharah (explaination) bayan karta hun. baat ye hai ke Allah Taala ne apne rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye us ghaneemat ka aik makhsoos hissey muqarrar kar diya tha. jisey Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bhi kisi doosrey ko nahi diya tha. phir aap ne us aayat ki tilawat ki وما أفاء الله على رسوله منهم‏ se Allah Taala ke irshad ( qadeer ( tak aur wo hissey Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye khas raha. magar qism Allah ki ye jaaidaad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tum ko chhod kar apne liye jod na rakhii, na khas apne kharch mein laaey, balke tum hi logon ko diin aur tumharey hi kaamon mein kharch kin. ye jo jaaidaad bach rahi hai is mein se aap apni beeviyon ka saal bhar ka kharch liya kartey iske baad jo baqi bachta wo Allah ke maal mein Sharik kar detey (jihad ke saman jutaaney mein) khair Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) to apni zindagi mein aisa hi kartey rahe. haaziriin tum ko Allah ki qism ! kya tum ye nahi jantey ? unhon-ne kaha beshak jantey hain. phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne Ali aur Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha, main aap hazraat se bhi qism de kar poochhta hun, kya aap log ye nahi jantey hain? ( donon hazraat ne jawab diya haan!) phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne yun farmaya ke phir Allah Taala ne apne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko duniya se utha liya to Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) kehney lagey ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka khaleefa hun, aur isliye unhon-ne (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki us mukhlis) jaaidaad par qabza kya aur jis tarah Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usmein masaarif kya kartey they, wo kartey rahe. Allah khub janta hai ke Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) apne us tarze-amal mein sachey mukhlis, neku-kaar aur haq ki pairwi karne waley they. phir Allah Taala ne Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ko bhi apne paas bula liya aur ab main Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ka naaib muqarrar hua. meri khilafat ko 2 saal ho gaey hain. aur maine bhi us jaaidaad ko apni tahweel mein rakha hai. jo kharchey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) usmein kya kartey they waisaa hi mein bhi karta raha aur Allah khub janta hai ke main apne us tarze-amal mein sachchaa, mukhlis aur haq ki pairwi karne wala hun. phir aap donon mere paas mujh se guftgu karne aaey aur ittifaq se guftgu karne lagey ke donon ka maqsad aik tha. janab Abbaas! aap to isliye tashrif laey ke aapko apne bhatijey (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki meeraas ka dawa mere samney pesh karna tha. phir Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaya ke aap isliye tashrif laey ke aapko apni biwi (Faatima (Raziallahu anhu)) ka dawa pesh karna tha ke unke walid (rasoolullaah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam)) ki meeraas unhein milnii chaahiye, maine aap donon hazraat se arz kar diya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khud farma gaey ke ham paighambaron ki koi meeraas taqseem nahi hoti, ham jo kuchh chhod jatey hain wo sadqa hota hai. phir mujh ko ye munasib malum hua ke main un jaaydaadon ko tumharey qabzey mein de dun, to maine tum se kaha, dekho agar tum chaho to main ye jaaidaad tumharey sipurd kar deta hun, lekin is ahad aur is iqrar par ke tum uski aamadni se wo sab kaam kartey rahogey jo Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) apni khilafat mein kartey rahe aur jo kaam main apni hukumat ke shuru se karta raha. tum ne is shart ko qabool karke darkhaast ki ke jaaydaadein ham ko de do. maine isi shart par de di, haaziriin kaho maine ye jaaydaadein isi shart par unke hawale ki hain ya nahi? unhon-ne kaha, beshak isi shart par aap ne di hain. phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne Ali (Raziallahu anhu) aur Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaya, main tum ko Allah ki qism deta hun, maine isi shart par ye jaaydaadein aap hazraat ke hawale ki hain ya nahi? unhon-ne kaha beshak. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, phir mujh se kis baat ka faisla chahtey ho? (kya jaaidaad ko taqseem karaanaa chahtey ho) qism Allah ki! jiske hukm se zameen aur aasman qaaim hain main to iske siwa aur koi faisla karne wala nahi. haan ! ye aur baat hai ke agar tum se iska intizam nahi ho sakta to phir jaaidaad mere sipurd kar do. mein iska bhi kaam dekh loonga."
"3095","qabila abdul-Qais ka wafad (darbaare-risaalat mein) hazir hua aur kaha ya Rasulullah ! hamara talluq qabila Rabee se hai aur qabila Muzar ke kuffaar hamarey aur aap ke beech mein baste hain. (is liye unke khatrey ki wjah se ham log) aap ki khidmat mein sirf adab waley mahinon mein hazir ho saktey hain. aap hamein koi aisa waazeh hukm farma dein jis par ham khud bhi mazbootii se qaaim rahen aur jo log hamarey sath nahi aa sakey hain unhein bhi bata dein. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya main tumhen char chizon ka hukm deta hun aur char chizon se roktaa hun (main tumhen hukm deta hun) Allah par eman laney ka ke Allah ke siwa aur koi maabood nahi aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne hath ko girah lagaaii, Namaz qaaim karne ka, zakat dene ka, Ramazan ke rozey rakhney ka, aur is baat ka ke jo kuchh bhi tumhen ghaneemat ka maal miley. usmein panchwan hissey (khums) Allah ke liye nikal do aur tumhen main dabaa, naqeer, hantam aur muzaffat ke istemal se roktaa hun."
"3096","ham se Abdullaah-bin-Yoosuf ne bayan kya, kaha ham ko imam Malik-bin-Anas ne bayan kya, unhein abu-Zinaad ne bayan kya, unhein Aaraj ne aur unhein Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne ke merey waaris merey baad aik deenaar bhii na baantein (meraa tarkaa taqseem na karein) main jo chhod jaun usmein se merey aamilon (governaron) ki tankhaah aur meri beeviyon ka kharch nikaalkar baqi sab sadqaa hai."""""
"3097","jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat hui to mere ghar mein aadhey wasq jo ke siwa jo aik taaq mein rakhey huey they aur koi cheez aisi nahi thi jo kisi jigar waley ( jaandaar ( ki khuraak bin sakti . main usi mein se khaatii rahi aur bahut din guzar gaey. phir maine usmein se naap kar nikaalnaa shuru kya to wo jaldi khatm ho gaey."
"3098","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (apni wafat ke baad) apne hathiyar , aik safaid khachchar , aur aik zameen jisey aap khud sadqa kar gaey they, ke siwa aur koi tarka nahi chhoda tha."
"3099","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke) maut ke marz mein) jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka marz bahut badh gaya, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sab beeviyon se uski ijazat chahi ke marz ke din aap mere ghar mein guzaarein . lihaza uski ijazat Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko mil gaee thi."
"3100","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mere ghar, meri baari ke din, mere halaq aur seeney ke darmyan tek lagaey huey wafat paaii, Allah Taala ne (wafaat ke waqt) mere thook aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke thook ko aik sath jama kar diya tha, bayan kya (wo is tarah ke) Abdur-Rehman (Raziallahu anhu)) Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke bhai ( miswak liye huey andar aaey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usey chabaa na sakey. isliye maine usey apne hath mein ley liya aur maine usey chabaaney ke baad wo miswak aap ke daanton par malii."
"3101","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi Safiya (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein khabar di ke wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein milney ke liye hazir huin. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Ramazan ke aakhiri Ashrey ka masjid mein aetikaf kiye huey they. phir wo wapas honey ke liye uthein to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi unke sath uthey . jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni paak bevi Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ke darwaza ke qareeb pahunchey jo masjide-Nabawi ke darwazey se mila hua tha to 2 Ansari sahabi ( Usaid-bin-Huzair (Raziallahu anhu) aur Ibaad-bin-Bishr (Raziallahu anhu)) wahan se guzrey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko unhon-ne salam kya aur aagey badhney lagey. lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya, zara thahar jao (mere sath meri biwi Safiya (Raziallahu anhu) hain yani koi doosra nahi ( un donon ne arz kya. sub'haan-Allaah, ya Rasulullah! un hazraat par aap ka ye farmana bada sakht guzraa. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke shaitan insan ke andar is tarah daudta rehta hai jaisey jism mein khoon daudta hai. mujhey yahi khatrah hua ke kahin tumharey dilon mein bhi koi waswasa paida na ho jaey."
"3102","main ( Ummul-Momenin ( Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ke ghar ke uper chadhaa, to dekha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) qazaey-hajat (zaroorat se farigh honey) kar rahe they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki peeth qible ki taraf thi aur chehra Mubarak Sham (Syria) ki taraf tha."
"3103","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Asr ki Namaz padhtey to dhoop abhi unke hujrey mein baqi rehti thi."
"3104","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khutba detey huey Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke hujre ki taraf ishara kya aur farmaya ke usi taraf se (yani mashriq ki taraf se) fitney barpa hongey, teen martaba Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne isi tarah farmaya ke yahin se shaitan ka sar namudaar hoga."
"3105","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke ghar mein maujood they. achcha unhon-ne suna ke koi sahib Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ke ghar mein andar aaney ki ijazat maang rahe hain. ( Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke) maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! aap dekhtey nahi, ye shakhs ghar mein janey ki ijazat maang raha hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke mera khayal hai ye falan sahib hain, Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ke dudh-sharik chacha ! razaat bhi un tamam chizon ko haram kar deti hai jinhein paidaaish haram karti hai."
"3106","jab Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) khaleefa huey to unhon-ne unko (yani Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ko) Bahrain (aamil bana kar) bheja aur aik parwaana likh kar unko diya aur is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki anguthi ki mehar lagaaii, mehar par teen linein khudii hui thin, aik line mein ''Muhammad'' dusri mein '' rasool'' teesri mein ''Allaah'' khuda hua tha."
"3107","Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne hamein 2 puraaney jootey nikal kar dikhaaey jin mein 2 tasmey lagey huey they, iske baad phir Sabit Bunani ne mujh se Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se bayan kya ke wo donon jootey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke they."
"3108","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne hamein aik pewand lagi hui chadar nikal kar dikhai aur batlaya ke isi kapdey main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Rooh qabz hui thi aur Sulaiman-bin Mughira ne Humaid se bayan kya, unhon-ne abu-Barda se itna zyada bayan kya ke Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne Yaman ki bani hui aik motii izaar ( tahmad (aur aik kambal unhiin kambalon mein se jinko tum malba (aur mota pewand daar kehtey ho ( hamein nikal kar dikhai ."
"3109","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka pani peeney ka piyala toot gaya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tootii hui jaghon ko chandi ki zanjeeron se judwaa liya. Aasim kehtey hain ke maine wo piyala dekha hai. aur is mein maine pani bhi piyaa hai."
"3110","jab ham sab hazraat Husain bin Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ki shahadat ke baad Yazeed-bin-Muaawiya ke yahan se Madina Munawra tashrif laey to Miswar-bin-Makhrama (Raziallahu anhu) ne aap se mulaqat ki, aur kaha agar aapko koi zarurat ho to mujhey hukm farma dijiye. (Zainul-Aabedeen ne bayan kya ke) maine kaha, mujhey koi zarurat nahi hai. phir Miswar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha to kya aap mujhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki talwaar inayat farmaaengey? kyonke mujhey khof hai ke kuchh log (banu-Umayya) usey aap se na chheen lein aur Allah ki qism ! agar wo talwaar aap mujhey inayat farma dein to koi shakhs bhi jab tak meri jaan baqi hai usey chheen nahi sakega. phir Miswar (Raziallahu anhu) ne aik qissa bayan kya ke Ali-bin abi-Talib (Raziallahu anhu) ne Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ki maujoodgii mein abu-Jahal ki aik beti ( jameela naam ke (Raziallahu anhu)) ko paigham nikah de diya tha. maine khud suna ke isi mas'ale par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne isi member par khadey ho kar sahaba ko khitab farmaya, mein us waqt baligh tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khutbe mein farmaya ke Fatima mujh se hai. aur mujhey dar hai ke kahin wo (is rishta ki wjah se) kisi gunah mein na pad jaey ke apne Deen mein wo kisi fitne mein mubtala ho. iske baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khandan banii-abd-Shams ke aik apne daamaad ( Aas bin Rabe (ka zikr kya aur daamaadii se mutaalliq aap ne unki tareef ki, aap ne farmaya ke unhon-ne mujh se jo baat kahi sach kahii, jo wada kya, usey pura kya. main kisi halal (yani nikah saanii) ko haram nahi kar sakta aur na kisi haram ko halal banata hun. lekin Allah ki qasam! Rasulullah ki beti aur Allah ke dushman ki beti aik sath jama nahi hoongii."
"3111","agar Ali (Raziallahu anhu) , Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ko bura kehney waley hotey to us din hotey jab kuchh log Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ke aamilon ki (jo zakat wsool kartey they) shikayat karne unke paas aaey. unhon-ne mujh se kaha Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas ja aur ye zakat ka parwaana ley jaa. unse kehna ke ye parwaana Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka likhwaayaa hua hai. tum apne aamilon ko hukm 2 ke wo usi ke mutabiq amal karein. chunanche main usey lekar Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur unhein paigham pahuncha diya, lekin unhon-ne farmaya ke hamein uski koi zarurat nahi (kyonke hamarey paas uski naql maujood hai) maine ja kar Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se ye waqia bayan kya, to unhon-ne farmaya ke achchha, phir us parwaaney ko jahan se uthaya hai wahin rakh do."
"3112","mere walid ( Ali (Raziallahu anhu)) ne mujh ko kaha ke ye parwaana Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ko ley ja kar de aao, usmein zakat se mutaalliq Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke bayan ki hui ehkaamaat darj hain."
"3113","Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ko chuki peesney ki bahut takleef hoti. phir unhein malum hua ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas kuchh qaidi aaey hain. isliye wo bhi unmein se aik londi ya ghulam ki darkhaast lekar hazir huin. lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) maujood nahi they. wo Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se iske mutaalliq keh kar) wapas ( chali aaein . phir jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey to Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney unki darkhaast pesh kar di. Ali (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey hain ke usey sun kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey yahan (raat hi ko) tashrif laey. jab ham apne bistaron par let chukey they (jab ham ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha (to ham log khadey honey lagey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jis tarah ho waisey hi letey raho. (phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere aur Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ke beech mein baith gaey aur itney qareeb ho gaey ke) maine aap ke donon qadmon ki thandak apne seeney par paaii. iske baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo kuchh tum logon ne (laundii ya ghulaam) maangey hain, main tumhen us se behtar baat kyon na bataaoon, jab tum donon apne bistar par let jao (to soney se pahley) Allahu-akbar 34 martaba aur al-Hamdulillah 33 martaba aur Subhan-Allah 33 martaba padh liya karo, ye amal behtar hai us se jo tum donon ne maanga hai."
"3114","ham ansaariyon ke qabeele mein aik Ansari ke ghar bachcha paida ho to unhon-ne bachchey ka naam Muhammad rakhney ka irada kya aur Shoba ne Mansoor se riwayat karke bayan kya hai ke un Ansari ne bayan kya (jinke yahan bachcha paida hua tha) ke main bachchey ko apni gardan par utha kar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur Sulaiman ki riwayat mein hai ke unke yahan bachcha paida hua, to unhon-ne uska naam Muhammad rakhna chaha, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke mere naam par naam rakho, lekin meri kunniyat ( abul-Qaasim ( par kunniyat na rakhna , kyonke mujhey taqseem karne wala ( Qasim ( banaya gaya hai. main tum mein taqseem karta hun, aur Husain ne (apni riwayat mein) yun bayan kya, ke mujhey taqseem karne wala ( Qasim ( bana kar bheja gaya hai, main tum mein taqseem karta hun. Amr-bin-Marzooq ne kaha ke hamein Shoba ne khabar di, unse Qatada ne bayan kya, unhon-ne Salim se suna unhon-ne Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se ke un Ansari sahabi ne apne bachchey ka naam Qasim rakhna chaha tha to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mere naam par naam rakho lekin kunniyat na rakho."
"3115","hamarey qabeele mein aik shakhs ke yahan bachcha paida hua, to unhon-ne uska naam Qasim rakha , Ansar kehney lagey ke ham tumhen abul-Qaasim keh kar kabhi nahi pukaarengey aur ham tumhari aankh thandii nahi karengey ye sun kar wo Ansari Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha ya Rasulullah ! mere ghar aik bachcha paida hua hai. maine uska naam Qasim rakha hai to Ansar kehtey hain ham teri kunniyat abul-Qaasim nahi pukaarengey aur teri aankh thandii nahi karengey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''ansaar ne theek kaha hai mere naam par naam rakho, lekin meri kunniyat mat rakho, kyonke Qasim main hon.''"
"3116","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jiske sath Allah Taala bhalai chahta hai usey Deen ki samajh de deta hai. aur dene wala to Allah hi hai main to sirf taqseem karne wala hun aur apne dushmanon ke muqaabley mein ye ummat (muslima) hamesha ghalib rahegi . yahan tak ke Allah ka hukm (qiyamat ( aa jaey aur us waqt bhi wo ghalib hi hongey.''"
"3117","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''na main tumhen koi cheez deta hun, na tum se kisi cheez ko roktaa hun. main to sirf taqseem karne wala hun. jahan jahaan ka mujhey hukm hota hai bas wahin rakh deta hoon.''"
"3118","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se maine suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farma rahe they kuchh log Allah Taala ke maal ko be-jaa udaatey hain, unhein qiyamat ke din aag milegii."
"3119","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' ghodon ki peshaaniyon se qiyamat tak khair w barkat ( aakhirat mein) aur ghaneemat ( duniya mein) bandhi hui hai.''"
"3120","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab Kisraa mar jaeyga to uske baad koi Kisraa paida na hoga aur jab qaisar mar jaeyga to uski baad koi qaisar paida na hoga aur us zaat ki qasam! jiske hath mein meri jaan hai, tum log un donon ke khazaaney Allah ke rastey mein kharch karogey.''"
"3121","rasoolullaah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab Kisraa mar jaeyga to uske baad koi Kisraa paida na hoga aur jab qaisar mar jaeyga to uski baad koi qaisar paida na hoga aur us zaat ki qasam! jiske hath mein meri jaan hai, tum log un donon ke khazaaney Allah ke rastey mein kharch karogey.''"
"3122","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmaya '' mere liye (muraad ummat hai) ghaneemat ke maal halal kiye gaey hain.''"
"3123","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo Allah ke rastey mein jihad karey, jihad hi ki niyat se nikley, Allah ke kalam (uske waadey ( ko sach jaan kar, to Allah uska zaamin hai. ya to Allah Taala usko Shahid karke jannat mein ley jaeyga ya usko sawab aur ghaneemat ka maal dila kar uske ghar lota laaeyga.''"
"3124","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''banii-Israaeel ke paighambaron mein se aik Nabi (Yoosha' (Alaihissalam) ( ne jang karne ka irada kya to apni qaum se kaha ke mere sath koi aisa shakhs jisne abhi nai shadi ki ho aur biwi ke sath raat bhi na guzari ho aur wo raat guzaarnaa chahta ho aur wo shakhs jisne ghar banaya ho aur abhi uski chhat na rakhi ho aur wo shakhs jisne haamla bakri ya haamla oontniyan kharidi hon aur usey unke bachchey janne ka intizar ho to (aisey logon mein se koi bhi) hamarey sath jihad mein na chaley. phir unhon-ne jihad kya, aur jab us aabadi (Areehaa) se qareeb huey to Asr ka waqt ho gaya ya iske qareeb waqt hua. unhon-ne suraj se farmaya ke to bhi Allah ka taabe'-farmaan hai aur main bhi uska taabe'-farmaan hun. aey Allah ! hamarey liye usey apni jagah par rok de. chunanche suraj ruk gaya, yahan tak ke Allah Taala ne unhein fateh inayat farmai . phir unhon-ne ghaneemat ke maalon ko jama kya aur aag usey jalaaney ke liye aai lekin jalaa na sakii, us Nabi ne farmaya ke tum mein se kisi ne maale-ghanimat mein chori ki hai. isliye har qabeele ka aik aadmi aa kar mere hath par bait karey (jab bait karne lagey to) aik qabeele ke shakhs ka hath unke hath se chimat gaya. unhon-ne farmaya, ke chori tumharey qabeele hi walon ne ki hai. ab tumharey qabeeley ke sab log aaein aur bait karein. chunanche us qabeeley ke do-teen aadmiyon ka hath is tarah unke hath se chimat gaya, to aap ne farmaya ke chori tumhen logon ne ki hai. (aakhir chori maan li gai) aur wo log gaaey ke sar ki tarah soney ka aik sar laey (jo ghaneemat mein se churaa liya gaya tha) aur usey maale-ghanimat mein rakh diya, tab aag aai aur usey jalaa gaee, phir ghaneemat Allah Taala ne hamarey liye jaaiz qarar de di, hamari kamzori aur aajizii ko dekha. isliye hamarey waastey halal qarar de di."
"3125","umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ''agar musalmanon ki aaney wali naslon ka khayal na hota to jo Shahar bhi fateh hota mein usey faatihon mein isi tarah taqseem kar diya karta jis tarah Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khaibar ki taqseem ki thii.''"
"3126","ham se abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke aik dehati ( laahiq bin zameera Bahili ( ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha aik shakhs hai jo ghaneemat hasil karne ke liye jihad mein Sharik hua, aik shakhs hai jo isliye shirkat karta hai ke uski bahaadurii ke charchey zabanon par aa jaaein, aik shakhs isliye ladtaa hai ke uski dhaak baith jaey, to unmein se Allah ke rastey mein kon sa hoga? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs jang mein shirkat isliye karey taake Allah ka kalima (deen) hi buland rahe. faqat wahi Allah ke rastey mein hai."
"3127","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein deebaa ki kuchh chaadarein tohfe ke taur par aai thin. jin mein soney ki ghundiyaan lagi hui thin, unhein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne chand ashaab mein taqseem farma diya aur aik chadar Makhrima bin Nofal (Raziallahu anhu) ke liye rakh li. phir Makhrima (Raziallahu anhu) aaey aur unke sath unke sahibzadey Miswar-bin-Makhrama (Raziallahu anhu) bhi they. aap darwazey par khadey ho gaey aur kaha ke mera naam lekar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bula la . Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki awaz suni to chadar lekar bahar tashrif laey aur uski ghundiyaan unke samney kar dein. phir farmaya : Abu-Miswar ! ye Quba maine tumharey liye chipa kar rakh li thi. Makhrima (Raziallahu anhu) zara tez tabeeat ke aadmi they. ibne-Ulaih ne Ayub ke waastey se ye hadis (mursalan hi) riwayat ki hai. aur Haatim-bin-Wardaan ne bayan kya ke ham se Ayub ne bayan kya, unse ibne-abi-Mulaika ne unse Miswar (Raziallahu anhu) ne ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke yahan kuchh qubaaein aaiin thin, is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Leis ne ibne-abi-Mulaika se ki hai."
"3128","sahaba ( Ansar ( kuchh khajoor ke darakht Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein bataur tohfa de diya kartey they lekin jab Allah Taala ne banu-Quraiza aur banu-Nazeer ke qabaayel par fateh di to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) iske baad is tarah ke hadiye wapas farma diya kartey they."
"3129","unse Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke jamal ki jang ke mauqe par jab Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) khadey huey to mujhey bulaya. main unke pahlu mein ja kar khada ho gaya, unhon-ne kaha betey ! aaj ki ladai mein zaalim maara jaeyga ya mazloom? main samajhta hun ke aaj main mazloom qatl kya jaaunga aur mujhey sabse zyada fikr apne qarzon ki hai. kya tumhen bhi kuchh andaza hai ke qarz ada karne ke baad hamara kuchh maal bach sakega? phir unhon-ne kaha betey ! hamara maal farokht karke us se qarz ada kar dena. iske baad unhon-ne aik tehai ki mere liye aur us tehai ke teesrey hisse ki wasiiyat mere bachchon ke liye ki, yani Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) ke bachchon ke liye. unhon-ne farmaya tha ke us tehai ke teen hissey kar lena aur agar qarz ki adaaeygi ke baad hamarey amwaal mein se kuchh bach jaey to uska aik tehai tumharey bachchon ke liye hoga. Hisham rawi ne bayan kya ke Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ke kuchh ladkey Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ke ladkon ke ham-umr they. jaisey Khubaib aur Ibad aur Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ke us waqt nau (9) ladkey aur nau (9) ladkiyan thin. Abdullah-bin-Zubair ne bayan kya ke phir Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) mujhey apne qarz ke silsiley mein wasiiyat karne lagey aur farmaney lagey ke betaa! agar qarz ada karne se aajiz ho jao to mere Malik w Maula se usmein madad chaahanaa. Abdullah ne bayan kya ke qism Allah ki! main unki baat na samajh sakaa, maine puchha ke baabaa aap ke Maula kon hain? unhon-ne farmaya ke Allah paak! Abdullah ne bayan kya, qism Allah ki ! qarz ada karne mein jo bhi dushwari samney aai to maine isi tarah dua ki, ke aey Zuber ke maulaa! unki taraf se unka qarz ada kara de aur adaaeygi ki sura paida ho jati thi. chunanche jab Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) (usi mauqe par) Shahid ho gaey to unhon-ne tarke mein dirham w Dinar nahi chhodey balke unka tarka kuchh to araazii ki sura mein tha aur usi mein Ghaaba ki zameen bhi shamil thi. gyara (11) makanon Madina mein they, 2 makan Basra mein they, aik makan Kufa mein tha aur aik misr mein tha. Abdullah ne bayan kya ke un par jo itna Sara qarz ho gaya tha uski sura ye hui thi ke jab unke paas koi shakhs apna maal lekar amanat rakhney aata to aap usey kehtey ke nahi albatta is sura mein rakh sakta hun ke ye mere zimmey bataur qarz rahe. kyonke mujhey iske zaaye ho janey ka bhi khof hai. Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) kisi ilaaqey ke ameer kabhi nahi baney they. na wo khiraaj wsool karne par kabhi muqarrar huey aur na koi doosra ohda unhon-ne qabool kya, albatta unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke saat"
"3130","Usman (Raziallahu anhu) badr ki ladai mein Sharik na ho sakey they. unke nikah main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aik sahibzadi thin aur wo bimar thin. unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tumhen bhi itna hi sawab milega jitna badr mein Sharik hone-waale kisi shakhs ko , aur itna hi hissey bhi milega."
"3131","jab Hawazin ka wafad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur apne maalon aur qaidiyon ki waapsii ka sawal kya, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke sachchii baat mujhey sabse zyada pasand hai. in donon chizon mein se tum aik hi wapas ley saktey ho. apne qaidi wapas ley lo ya phir maal ley lo, aur maine tumhara intizar bhi kya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne taqriban das din tak Taaif se waapsii par unka intizar kya aur jab ye baat un par waazeh ho gaee ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unki sirf aik hi cheez ( qaidi ya maal ( wapas kar saktey hain to unhon-ne kaha ke ham apne qaidi hi wapas lena chahtey hain. ab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne musalmanon ko khitab farmaya : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Allah ki shaan ke mutabiq hamd w sana karne ke baad farmaya ''ammaa ba'd! tumharey ye bhai ab hamarey paas tauba karke aaey hain aur main munasib samajhta hun ke unke qaidi unhein wapas kar diye jaaein. isi liye jo shakhs apni khushi se ghaneemat ke apne hissey ke (qaidii) wapas karna chahey wo kar de aur jo shakhs chahta ho ke iska hissey baqi rahe aur hamein jab iske baad sabse pehli ghaneemat miley to usmein se iske hissey ki adaaeygi kar di jaey to wo bhi apne qaidi wapas kar de, (aur jab hamein doosrey ghaneemat milegii to uska hissey ada kar diya jaaeyga).'' is par sahaba kiram (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah! ham apni khushi se unhein apne hissey wapas kar detey hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''lekin hamein ye malum na ho saka ke kin logon ne apni khushi se ijazat di aur kin logon ne nahi di hai. isliye sab log (apne khemon mein) wapas chaley jayen aur tumharey sardaar log tumhari baat hamarey samney aa kar bayan karein.'' sab log wapas chaley gaey aur unke sardaaron ne us masla par guftgu ki aur phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aa kar khabar di ke sab log khushi se ijazat detey hain. yahi wo khabar hai jo Hawazin ke qaidiyon ke silsiley mein hamein malum hui hai."
"3132","jab Hawazin ka wafad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur apne maalon aur qaidiyon ki waapsii ka sawal kya, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke sachchii baat mujhey sabse zyada pasand hai. in donon chizon mein se tum aik hi wapas ley saktey ho. apne qaidi wapas ley lo ya phir maal ley lo, aur maine tumhara intizar bhi kya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne taqriban das din tak Taaif se waapsii par unka intizar kya aur jab ye baat un par waazeh ho gaee ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unki sirf aik hi cheez ( qaidi ya maal ( wapas kar saktey hain to unhon-ne kaha ke ham apne qaidi hi wapas lena chahtey hain. ab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne musalmanon ko khitab farmaya : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Allah ki shaan ke mutabiq hamd w sana karne ke baad farmaya ''ammaa ba'd! tumharey ye bhai ab hamarey paas tauba karke aaey hain aur main munasib samajhta hun ke unke qaidi unhein wapas kar diye jaaein. isi liye jo shakhs apni khushi se ghaneemat ke apne hissey ke (qaidii) wapas karna chahey wo kar de aur jo shakhs chahta ho ke iska hissey baqi rahe aur hamein jab iske baad sabse pehli ghaneemat miley to usmein se iske hissey ki adaaeygi kar di jaey to wo bhi apne qaidi wapas kar de, (aur jab hamein doosrey ghaneemat milegii to uska hissey ada kar diya jaaeyga).'' is par sahaba kiram (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah! ham apni khushi se unhein apne hissey wapas kar detey hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''lekin hamein ye malum na ho saka ke kin logon ne apni khushi se ijazat di aur kin logon ne nahi di hai. isliye sab log (apne khemon mein) wapas chaley jayen aur tumharey sardaar log tumhari baat hamarey samney aa kar bayan karein.'' sab log wapas chaley gaey aur unke sardaaron ne us masla par guftgu ki aur phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aa kar khabar di ke sab log khushi se ijazat detey hain. yahi wo khabar hai jo Hawazin ke qaidiyon ke silsiley mein hamein malum hui hai."
"3133","ham abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) ki majlis mein hazir they ( khana laya gaya aur) wahan murghi ka zikr honey laga. bani Tameem Allah ke aik aadmi surkh rang waley wahan maujood they. ghaaliban aazad kiye hue ghulaamon mein se they. unhein bhi abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ne khaney par bulaya , wo kehney lagey ke maine murghi ko gandii cheezein khaatey aik martaba dekha tha to mujhey badi nafrat hui aur maine qism kha li ke ab kabhi murghi ka gosht na khaaunga. abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke qareeb aa jao (tumhaarii qism par) main tum se aik hadis usi silsiley ki bayan karta hun, qabila ash'ar ke chand logon ko sath lekar main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat main (jange-Tabook ke liye) hazir hua aur sawari ki darkhaast ki. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah ki qasam! main tumharey liye sawari ka intizam nahi kar sakta, kyonke mere paas koi aisi cheez nahi hai jo tumhari sawari ke kaam aa sakey.'' phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein ghaneemat ke kuchh oont aaey, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamarey mutaalliq malum farmaya, aur farmaya ke qabila ash'ar ke log kahan hain? chunanche Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne panch oont hamein diye janey ka hukm saadir farmaya, khub motey-taazey aur farba. jab ham chalney lagey to ham ne aapas mein kaha ke jo naa-munaasib tariqa ham ne ikhtiyar kya us se Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke us Atiya mein hamarey liye koi barkat nahi ho saktii. chunanche ham phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur arz kya ke ham ne pahley jab aap se darkhaast ki thi to aap ne qism kha kar farmaya tha ke main tumhari sawari ka intizam nahi kar sakoonga. shayad aapko wo qism yad na rahi ho, lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke maine tumhari sawari ka intizam waqei nahi kya, wo Allah Taala hai jisne tumhen ye sawaariyaan de di hain. Allah ki qism ! tum is par yaqin rakho ke inshaAllah jab bhi mein koi qism khaaun , phir mujh par ye baat zahir ho jaey ke behtar aur munasib tarze-amal iske siwa mein hai to main wahi karunga jis mein achai hogi aur qism ka kaffara de doonga."
"3134","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Najad ki taraf aik lashkar rawaana kya. Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) bhi lashkar ke sath they. ghaneemat ke taur par oonton ki aik badi tadaad us lashkar ko milii. isliye iske har sipaahii ko hisse mein bhi baara baara gyara (11) gyara oont miley they aur eik-eik oont aur inaam mein mila."
"3135","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kuchh muhimon ke mauqe par usmein Sharik honey walon ko ghaneemat ke aam hisson ke ilawa (khums wghaira mein se) apne taur par bhi diya kartey they."
"3136","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki hijrat ki khabar hamein milii, to ham Yaman mein they. isliye ham bhi aap ki khidmat mein muhajir ki haisiyat se hazir honey ke liye rawaana huey. main tha, mere bhai they. (meri umr un donon se kam thi, donon bhaiyon mein) aik abu-Barda (Raziallahu anhu) they aur doosrey abu-Raham. ya unhon-ne ye kaha ke apni qaum ke chand afraad ke sath ya ye kaha tirpan ya baawan aadmiyon ke sath (ye log rawaana huey they) ham kashtii mein sawar huey to hamari kashtii Najashi ke mulk Habsha pahunch gaee aur wahan hamein Jafar bin abii-Taalib (Raziallahu anhu) apne doosrey sathiyon ke sath miley. Jafar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein yahan bheja tha aur hukm diya tha ke ham yahin rahen. chunanche ham bhi wahin thahar gaey aur phir sab aik sath (Madeena) hazir huey, jab ham khidmat nabwi mein pahunchey, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khaibar fateh kar chukey they. lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (doosrey mujaahidon ke saath) hamara bhi hissey maale-ghanimat mein lagaya. ya unhon-ne ye kaha ke aap ne ghaneemat mein se hamein bhi ata farmaya, halanke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kisi aisey shakhs ka ghaneemat mein hissey nahi lagaya jo ladai mein Sharik na raha ho. sirf unhi logon ko hissey mila tha, jo ladai mein Sharik they. albatta hamarey kashtii ke sathiyon aur Jafar aur unke sathiyon ko bhi aap ne ghaneemat mein Sharik kya tha (halanke ham log ladai mein Sharik nahi huey they)."
"3137","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke jab Bahrain se wsool ho kar mere paas maal aayega to main tumhen is-is tarah aur is tarah (teen lap ( doonga iske baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat ho gaee aur Bahrain ka maal us waqt tak na aaya. phir jab wahan se maal aaya to Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke hukm se manaadii ne elaan kya ke jiska bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par koi qarz ho ya aap ka koi wada ho to hamarey paas aaey. mein Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein gaya aur arz kya ke mujh se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye farmaya tha. chunanche unhon-ne teen lap bhar kar mujhey diya. Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne apne donon hathon se ishara karke ( lap bharney ki) kaifiyat batai phir ham se Sufiyan ne bayan kya ke ibne-Munkadir ne bhi ham se isi tarah bayan kya tha aur aik martaba Sufiyan ne (pichhli sanad ke saath) bayan kya ke Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein hazir hua to unhon-ne mujhey kuchh nahi diya. phir main hazir hua, aur is martaba bhi mujhey unhon-ne kuchh nahi diya. phir main teesri martaba hazir hua aur arz kya ke maine aik martaba aap se maanga aur aap ne inayat nahi farmaya, dobara maanga , phir bhi aap ne inayat nahi farmaya aur phir maanga lekin aap ne inayat nahi farmaya, ab ya aap mujhey dijiye ya phir mere barey mein kanjoosii se kaam liijiye, Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke tum kehtey ho ke mere mamley mein kanjoosii se kaam leta hai. halanke tumhen deney se jab bhi maine munh phera to mere dil mein ye baat hoti thi ke tumhen kabhi na kabhi dena zaroor hai. Sufiyan ne bayan kya ke ham se Amr ne bayan kya, unse Muhammad-bin Ali ne aur unse Jaabir ne, phir Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujhey aik lap bhar kar diya aur farmaya ke usey shumaar kar maine shumaar kya to panch so ki tadaad thi, iske baad Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke itna hi 2 martaba aur ley-ley. aur ibne-munkadir ne bayan kya (ke Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya tha) kanjoosii se zyada badtareen aur kya bimari ho sakti hai."
"3138","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) maqam Jaarana mein ghaneemat taqseem kar rahe they ke aik shakhs zul-khuwesra ne aap se kaha, insaf se kaam lijiye , Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''agar main bhi insaf se kaam na loon to bad-bakht hua.''"
"3139","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne badr ke qaidiyon ke barey mein farmaya tha ke agar mut'im-bin-adii (jo kufr ki haalat mein mar gaey they) zinda hotey aur in naapaak, napak logon ki sifarish kartey to main unki sifarish se inhein (fidya liye baghair) chhod detaa."
"3140","main aur Usman-bin-Affan (Raziallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur arz kya, ya Rasulullah! aap ne banu-Muttalib ko to inayat farmaya lekin ham ko chhod diya, halanke ham ko aap se wahi rishta hai jo banu-Muttalib ko aap se hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke banu-Muttalib aur banu-Haashim aik hi hai. Leis ne bayan kya ke mujh se Yunus ne bayan kya aur (is riwayat mein) ye zyadti ki ke Juber (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne banu-Abd-Shams aur banu-Naufal ko nahi diya tha, aur ibne-Ishaq (saahib maghaazii) ne kaha hai ke Abd-Shams, Hashim aur muttalib aik maan se they aur unki maan ka naam Aatika-bin-Murra tha aur Nofal bap ki taraf se unke bhai they (unki maan dusri thiin)."
"3141","badr ki ladai mein, main saf ke sath khada hua tha. maine jo daain-baaiin taraf dekha, to mere donon taraf qabila Ansar ke 2 nau-umr ladkey they. maine aarzoo ki kash! mein unse zabardast zyada umr walon ke beech mein hota. aik ne meri taraf ishara kya, aur puchha chacha ! aap abu-Jahal ko bhi pehchantey hain? maine kaha ke haan! lekin betey tum logon ko us se kya kaam hai? ladkey ne jawab diya mujhey malum hua hai ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko gaaliyaan deta hai, us zaat ki qism ! jiske hath mein meri jaan hai agar mujhey wo mil gaya to us waqt tak mein us se juda na hunga jab tak ham mein se koi jiski qismat mein pahley marnaa hoga, mar na jaey, mujhey is par badi hairat hui. phir doosrey ne ishara kya aur wahi baatein usne bhi kahiin. abhi chand minute hi guzrey they ke mujhey abu-Jahal dikhai diya jo logon mein (kuffaar ke lashkar mein) ghoomtaa phir raha tha. maine un ladkon se kaha ke jiske mutaalliq tum log mujh se poochh rahe they, wo samney ( phirtaa hua nazar aa raha ( hai. donon ne apni talwaarein sanbhaaliin aur is par jhapat padey aur hamla karke usey qatl kar dala. iske baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar aapko khabar di, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha ke tum donon mein se kis ne usey maara hai? donon naujawaanon ne kaha ke maine qatl kya hai. isliye aap ne unse puchha ke kya apni talwaarein tum ne saaf kar li hain? unhon-ne arz kya ke nahi. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne donon talwaaron ko dekha aur farmaya ke tum donon hi ne usey maara hai. aur uska saman Muaaz-bin-Amr-bin-Jamooa' ko milega. wo donon naujawaan Muaaz-bin-Ifraa aur Muaaz-bin-Amr-bin-Jamooa' they Muhammad ne kaha Yusuf ne Saleh se suna aur Ibrahim ne apne bap se suna."
"3142","jange-Hunain ke saal ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath rawaana huey. phir jab hamara dushman se saamnaa hua to ( shuruaat mein) Islami lashkar haarney laga. itney mein maine dekha ke mushrekeen ke lashkar ka aik shakhs aik musalman ke uper chadhaa hua hai. isliye main fauran hi ghoom padaa aur uske peechhey se aa kar talwaar uski gardan par maarii. ab wo shakhs mujh par toot padaa, aur mujhey itni zor se us ne bheencha ke meri Rooh jaisey qabz honey ko thi. aakhir jab usko maut ne aa dabochaa, tab kahin ja kar usne mujhey chhodaa. iske baad mujhey Umar-bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) miley, to maine unse puchha ke musalman ab kis haalat mein hain? unhon-ne kaha ke jo Allah ka hukm tha wahi hua. lekin musalman haarney ke baad phir muqable par sanbhal gaey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baith gaey aur farmaya ke jisne bhi kisi kaafir ko qatl kya ho aur is par wo gawah bhi pesh kar de to maqtool ka Sara saaz w saman usey hi milega ( abu-Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ( mein bhi khada hua aur maine kaha ke meri taraf se kon gawahi dega ? lekin (jab meri taraf se koi na utha to ( mein baith gaya. phir dobara Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke) aaj ( jisne kisi kaafir ko qatl kya aur is par uski taraf se koi gawah bhi ho to maqtool ka Sara saman usey milega. is martaba phir maine khadey ho kar kaha ke meri taraf se kon gawahi dega ? aur phir mujhey baithna padaa. teesri martaba phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wahi irshad dohraya aur us martaba jab main khada hua to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khud hi malum farmaya, kis cheez ke mutaalliq keh rahe ho abu-Qataada! maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney Sara waqia bayan kar diya, to aik sahib ( Aswad bin Khuzai Aslamii) ne bataya ke abu-Qatada sach kehtey hain, ya Rasulullah ! aur us maqtool ka saman mere paas mehfooz hai. aur mere haq mein unhein razi kar dijiye (ke wo maqtool ka saman mujh se na lein) lekin Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke nahi Allah ki qism ! Allah ke aik sher ke saath, jo Allah aur uske rasool ke liye ladey , Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aisa nahi karengey ke unka saman tumhen de dein, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Abu-Bakar ne sach kaha hai. phir aap ne saman abu-Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) ko ata farmaya, abu-Qatada ne kaha ke phir uski zirah bech kar maine bani Salma mein aik baagh khareed liya aur ye pahlaa maal tha jo Islam laney ke baad maine hasil kya tha."
"3143","Hakeem-bin-Hizaam (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya, maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kuchh rupya maanga to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey ata farmaya, phir dobara maine maanga aur us martaba bhi aap ne ata farmaya, phir irshad farmaya, hakeem ! ye maal dekhney mein sar-sabz bahut meethaa aur mazedaar hai lekin jo shakhs usey dil ki be-gharzii ke sath ley uske maal main to barkat hoti hai aur jo shakhs isey laalach aur hirs ke sath ley to uske maal mein barkat nahi hoti, balke uski misal us shakhs jaisi hai jo khaaey jata hai lekin uska pet nahi bharta aur uper ka hath (dene wala) nichey ke hath ( leney waale) se behtar hota hai. Hakeem-bin-Hizaam (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! aap ke baad ab main kisi se kuchh bhi nahi maangonga, yahan tak ke us duniya mein se chala jaaunga. chunanche (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat ke baad) Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) unhein dene ke liye bulaatey, lekin wo usmein se aik paisaa bhi leney se inkar kar detey. phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) (apne zamana khilafat mein) unhein dene ke liye bulatey aur unse bhi leney se unhon-ne inkar kar diya. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne is par kaha ke musalmaanon! main unhein unka haq deta hun jo Allah Taala ne faiy ke maal se unka hissey muqarrar kya hai. lekin ye usey bhi qabool nahi kartey. Hakeem-bin-Hizaam (Raziallahu anhu) ki wafat ho gaee lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baad unhon-ne kisi se koi cheez nahi li."
"3144","umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! zamana jahiliyat ( kufr ( mein maine aik din ke aetikaf ki mannat maana thi, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey pura karne ka hukm farmaya, Naafe ne bayan kya ke Hunain ke qaidiyon mein se umr (Raziallahu anhu) ko 2 baandiyaan mili thin. to aap ne unhein Makka ke kisi ghar mein rakha. unhon-ne bayan kya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hunain ke qaidiyon par ehsan kya (aur sab ko muft aazad kar diyaa) to galiyon mein wo daudney lagey. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, Abdullaah! dekho to ye kya mamla hai. unhon-ne bataya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un par ehsan kya hai (aur Hunain ke tamam qaidi muft aazad kar diye gaey hain) umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke phir ja un donon ladkiyon ko bhi aazad kar de. Naafe ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne maqam Jaarana se Umre ka ehram nahi baandha tha. agar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wahan se Umre ka ehram baandhtey to Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye zaroor malum hota aur Jareer-bin-Haazim ne jo Ayub se riwayat ki, unhon-ne Naafe se, unhon-ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se, usmein yun hai ke (wo donon baandiyaan jo umr (Raziallahu anhu) ko mili thiin) khums mein se thin. (aitikaaf se mutaalliq ye riwaayat) Mamar ne Ayub se naql ki hai, unse Naafe ne, unse Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne nazar ka qissa jo riwayat kya hai is mein aik din ka lafz nahi hai."
"3145","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kuchh logon ko diya aur kuchh logon ko nahi diya. ghaaliban jin logon ko Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne nahi diya tha, unko na-gawar hua. to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main kuchh aisey logon ko deta hun ke mujhey jinke bigad janey (Islam se phir janey (aur be-sabrii ka dar hai. aur kuchh log aisey hain jin par main bharosa karta hun, Allah Taala ne unke dilon mein bhalai aur be niyaazii rakhi hai (unko mein nahi detaa) Amr bin taghlab (Raziallahu anhu) bhi unhiin mein shamil hain. Amr bin taghlab (Raziallahu anhu) kaha kartey they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne meri nisbat ye jo kalima farmaya agar iske badley surkh oont miltey to bhi mein itna khush na hota. abu-Aasim ne Jarir se bayan kya ke maine Hasan Basri se suna, wo bayan kartey they ke ham se Amr bin taghlab (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas maal ya qaidi aaey they aur unhiin ko aap ne taqseem farmaya tha."
"3146","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Quraish ko main unka dil milaaney ke liye deta hun, kyonke unki jahiliyat ( kufr (ka zamana abhi taaza guzra hai (unki diljoii karna zaroori hai).''"
"3147","jab Allah Taala ne apne rasool ko qabila Hawazin ke maalon mein se ghaneemat di aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Quraish ke kuchh aadmiyon ko (dilon ko parchaaney se) so-so oont dene lagey to kuchh Ansari logon ne kaha Allah Taala Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki bakhshish kare. aap Quraish ko to de rahe hain aur hamein chhod diya. halanke unka khoon abhi tak hamari talwaaron se tapak raha hai. ( Quraish ke logon ko haal hi mein ham ne maara , unke Shahar ko ham hi ne fateh kya ( Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko jab ye khabar pahunchi to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ansar ko bulaya aur unhein chamdey ke aik derey mein jama kya, unke siwa kisi doosrey sahabi ko Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne nahi bulaya. jab sab Ansari log jama ho gaey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi tashrif laey aur malum farmaya ke aap logon ke barey mein jo baat mujhey malum hui wo kahan tak sahi hai? Ansar ke samajh daar logon ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! ham mein jo aql waley hain, wo to koi aisi baat zaban par nahi laey hain, haan chand nau-umr ladkey hain, unhon-ne ye kaha hai ke Allah Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki bakhshish karey, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Quraish ko to de rahe hain aur ham ko nahi detey halanke hamari talwaaron se abhi tak unke khoon tapak rahe hain. is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main kuchh aisey logon ko deta hun jinka kufr ka zamana abhi guzra hai. (aur unko de kar unka dil milaataa hun) kya tum is par khush nahi ho ke jab doosrey log maal w daulat lekar wapas ja rahe hongey, to tum log apne gharon ko Rasulullah ko lekar wapas ja rahe hogey. Allah ki qasam! tumharey sath jo kuchh wapas ja raha hai wo us se behtar hai jo doosrey log apne sath wapas ley jaengey. sab ansaariyon ne kaha : beshak ya Rasulullah! ham is par razi aur khush hain. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ''mere baad tum ye dekhogey ke tum par doosrey logon ko muqaddam kya jaeyga us waqt tum sabr karnaa, (dangaa fasaad na karnaa) yahan tak ke Allah Taala se ja milo aur uske rasool se hauze-kausar par.'' Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya, phir ham se sabr na ho saka."
"3148","mere bap Muhammad-bin-Jubair ne kaha aur unhein Juber bin Mut-im (Raziallahu anhu) ne khabar di ke ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they. aap ke sath aur bhi sahaba they. Hunain ke jihad se waapsii ho rahi thi. rastey mein kuchh baddoo Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se lipat gaey (loot ka maal) aap se maangtey they. wo aap se aisa liptey ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aik babool ke darakht ki taraf dhakel ley gaey. aap ki chadar usmein atak kar reh gaee. us waqt aap thahar gaey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' (bhaaiyo) meri chadar to de do. agar mere paas un kaantey daar darakhton ki tadaad mein oont hotey to wo bhi tum mein taqseem kar detaa. tum mujhey kanjoos, jhoota aur buzdil hargiz nahi paaogey.''"
"3149","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath ja raha tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Najran ki bani hui chaudey haashiya ki aik chadar odhey huey they. itney mein aik dehati ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko gher liya aur zor se aapko kheenchaa, maine aap ke shaaney ko dekha, is par chadar ke koney ka nishan pad gaya, aisa kheenchaa. phir kehney laga. Allah ka maal jo aap ke paas hai is mein se kuchh mujh ko dilaaiye . Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uski taraf dekha aur hans diye. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey dene ka hukm farmaya."
"3150","Hunain ki ladai ke baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (ghaneemat ki) taqseem mein kuchh logon ko zyada diya. jaisey Aqra-bin-Habis (Raziallahu anhu) ko so oont diye, itney hi oont Uena-bin-Husain (Raziallahu anhu) ko diye aur kai Arab ke ashraaf logon ko isi tarah taqseem mein zyada diya. is par aik shakhs (mau'tab bin-Qushair munafiq ( ne kaha, ke Allah ki qasam! is taqseem mein na to adl ko malhooz rakha gaya hai aur na Allah ki khushnoodii ka khayal hua. maine kaha ke Allah ki qism ! iski khabar main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko zaroor doonga . chunanche main aap ki khidmat mein hazir hua, aur aapko uski khabar di. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sun kar farmaya ''agar Allah aur uska rasool bhi adl na karey to phir kon adl karega. Allah Taala Musa (Alaihissalam) par raham farmaai ke unko logon ke hath us se bhi zyada takleef pahunchi lekin unhon-ne sabr kya.''"
"3151","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ko jo zameen inayat farmai thi, mein usmein se guthliyaan (so kabhi khajoorein) apne sar par laya karti thi. wo jagah mere ghar se 2 mail farsakh ki 2 tehai par thi. abu-Zamra ne Hisham se bayan kya aur unhon-ne apne bap se (mursalan) bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ko bani Nazir ki araazii mein se aik zameen qat'aa ke taur par di thii."
"3152","umr ne yahood w nasara ko sar zameene-hijaaz se nikal kar dusri jagah basaa diya tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jab khaibar fateh kya to aap ka bhi irada hua tha ke yahudiyon ko yahan se nikal diya jaey. jab aap ne fateh paai to us waqt wahan ki kuchh zameen yahudiyon ke qabzey mein hi thi aur aksar zameen paighambar (Alaihissalam) aur musalmanon ke qabzey mein thi. lekin phir yahudiyon ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se darkhaast ki, aap zameen unhiin ke paas rehney dein. wo (kheton aur baaghon mein) kaam kya karengey aur aadhi paidawar lengey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''achchha jab tak ham chaahengey us waqt tak ke liye tumhen is shart par yahan rehney dengey. chunanche ye log wahin rahe aur phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein apne daure-khilaafat main (musalmanon ke khilaf unke fitnon aur saazishon ki wjah se yahood khaibar ko) teemaa ya Areehaa ki taraf nikal diya tha.''"
"3153","ham khaibar ke mahal ka muhaasra kiye huey they. kisi shakhs ne aik kuppii phenkii jis mein charbi bhari hui thi. main usey leney ke liye lapkaa, lekin mud kar jo dekha to paas hi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) maujood they. main sharm se pani paanii ho gaya."
"3154","(Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamaney mein) jangon mein hamein shehad aur angoor milta tha. ham usey usi waqt kha letey (taqseem ke liye utha na rakhtey) ."
"3155","jang khaibar ke mauqe par faaqon par faaqey honey lagey. aakhir jis din khaibar fateh hua to (maale-ghaneemat mein) gharelu gadhey bhi hamein miley. chunanche unhein zabah karke (pakaanaa shuru kar diya gaya) jab haandiyon mein josh aaney laga to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke manaadii ne elaan kya ke haandiyon ko ulat 2 aur gharelu gadhey ke gosht mein se kuchh na khaao. Abdullaah-bin-abi-Aufii (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke kuchh logon ne is par kaha ke ghaaliban Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne isliye rok diya hai ke abhi tak usmein se khums nahi nikala gaya tha. lekin kuchh doosrey sahaba ne kaha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne gadhey ka gosht qatae taur par haram qarar diya hai. (shebaanii ne bayan kya ke) maine Saeed-bin-Jubair (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha to unhon-ne kaha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey qatae taur par haram kar diya tha."
"3156","main Jaabir bin Zaid aur Amr bin Aus ke sath betha hua tha to un donon buzurgon se Bajaala ne bayan kya ke 70 hijri mein jis saal Musab bin Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ne Basra walon ke sath Haj kya tha. zamzam ki seedhiyon ke paas unhon-ne bayan kya tha ke main Ahnaf bin Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ke chacha Juz-bin-Muaawiya ka kaatib tha. to wafat se aik saal pahley umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ka aik khat hamarey paas aaya ke jis paarsii ne apni mohrim (ehraam walaa shakhs) aurat ko biwi banaya ho to unko juda kar do aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne paarsiyon se jiziya nahi liya tha."
"3157","lekin jab Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf (Raziallahu anhu) ne gawahi di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hijr ke paarsiyon se jiziya liya tha (to wo bhi leney lagey they)."
"3158","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne abu-Ubaida-bin-Jarraah (Raziallahu anhu) ko Bahrain jiziya wsool karne ke liye bheja tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Bahrain ke logon se suleh ki thi aur un par Alaa-bin-Hizramii (Raziallahu anhu) ko Hakim banaya tha. jab abu-Ubaida (Raziallahu anhu) Bahrain ka maal lekar aaey to Ansar ko malum ho gaya ke abu-Ubaida (Raziallahu anhu) aagey hain. chunanche fajr ki Namaz sab logon ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath padhi. jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Namaz padha chukey to log Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney aaey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhein dekh kar muskuraaey aur farmaya ke mera khayal hai ke tum ne sun liya hai ke abu-Ubaida kuchh lekar aaey hain? Ansar (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya ji haan, ya Rasulullah! Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, tumhen khushkhabri ho, aur us cheez ke liye tum pur-ummeed raho. jis se tumhen khushi hogi, lekin Allah ki qasam! main tumharey barey mein mohtaajii aur faqr se nahi dartaa. mujhey agar khof hai to is baat ka kuchh duniya ke darwazey tum par is tarah khol diye jaeinge jaisey tum se pahley logon par khol diye gaey they, to aisa na ho ke tum bhi unki tarah aik doosrey se jalney lago aur ye jalnaa tum ko bhi isi tarah tabah kar de jaisa ke pahley logon ko kya tha."
"3159","kuffaar se jang ke liye umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne faujon ko) Faaris ke) badey badey shehron ki taraf bheja tha. (jab lashkar qaadsiya pahuncha aur ladai ka nateeja musalmanon ke haq mein niklaa) to harmuzaan (Shoster ka haakim) Islam ley aaya. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne us se farmaya ke main tum se un (mumaalik Faaris wghaira) par fauj bhejney ke silsiley mein mashwara chahta hun (ke pahley un teen maqaamon Faaris , Asfahaan aur aazarbaaijaan mein kahan se ladai shuru ki jaey) usne kaha ji haan! us mulk ki misal aur is mein rehney waley Islam dushman baashindon ki misal aik parindey jaisi hai jiska sar hai, 2 bazu hain. agar uska aik bazu tod diya jaey to wo apne donon paon par aik bazu aur aik sar ke sath khada reh sakta hai. agar doosra bazu bhi tod diya jaey to donon paon aur sar ke sath khada reh sakta hai. lekin agar sar tod diya jaey to donon paon donon bazu aur sar sab be-kaar reh jata hai. to sar to Kisraa hai, aik bazu qaisar hai aur doosra faaras! isliye aap musalmanon ko hukm de dein ke pahley wo Kisraa par hamla karein aur Bakr-bin-Abdullaah aur Ziyad bin-Jubair donon ne bayan kya ke unse Jubair-bin-Hayi ne bayan kya ke hamein umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne (jihad ke liye) bulaya aur Naumaan-bin-Muqrin (Raziallahu anhu) ko hamara ameer muqarrar kya. jab ham dushman ki sar zameen ( nahaawand (ke qareeb pahunchey to Kisraa ka aik afsar chalis (40) hazaar ka lashkar sath liye huey hamarey muqable ke liye badha . phir aik tarjuman ne aa kar kaha ke tum mein se koi aik shakhs ( maamlaat par) guftgu kare. Mughira-bin-Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) ne ( musalmanon ki numaaindagii ki aur) farmaya ke jo tumharey mataalbaat (maangein) hon, unhein bayan karo. us ne puchha aakhir tum log ho kon ? Mughira (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ham Arab ke rehney waley hain, ham intihai bd-bakhtiyon aur museebaton mein mubtala they. bhook ki shiddat mein ham chamdey, aur guthliyaan choosaa kartey they. oon aur baal hamari poshak thi aur pattharon aur darakhton ki ham ibadat kya kartey they. hamari museebatein isi tarah qaaim thin ke aasman aur zameen ke rab ne, jiska zikr apni tamam azmat w jalaal ke sath buland hai. hamari taraf hamari hi tarah (ke insani aadaat w khususiyaat rakhney wala) aik Nabi bhejaa. ham uske bap aur maan ko jantey hain. Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein hukm diya ke ham tum se us waqt tak jang kartey rahen. jab tak tum sirf Allah akeley ki ibadat na karne lago . ya phir Islam na qabool karne ki sura mein jiziya dena qabool kar lo aur hamarey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein apne rab ka ye paigham bhi pahunchaya hai ke (Islam ke liye ladtey huey) jihad mein hamara jo aadmi bhi qatl kya jaeyga wo aisi jannat mein jaeyga jo usney kabhi nahi dekhi aur jo log ham mein se zinda baqi reh jaeinge wo (fatah hasil karke) tum par Hakim bin sakengey (mugheera (Raziallahu anhu) ne ye guftgu tamam karke Nauman (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha ladai shuru karo)."
"3160","tum ko to Allah paak aisi kai ladaaiyon main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Sharik rakh chuka hai. aur us ne (ladaaii mein der karne par) tum ko na sharminda kya na zaleel kya aur main to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath ladai mein maujood tha. aap ka qaayeda tha agar subah sawerey ladai shuru na kartey aur din chadh jata to us waqt tak thahrey rahtey ke suraj dhal jaey, hawaaein chalney lagein, namazon ka waqt aan pahunchey."
"3161","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath ham jange-Tabook mein Sharik they. iila ke Hakim (Yuhanna-bin-Rooba) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aik safaid khachchar bheja aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey aik chadar bataur poshaak ke aur aik tahreer ke zariey uske mulk par usey hi Hakim baqi rakha."
"3162","maine Umar-bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se suna tha, (jab wo zakhmi huey) aap se ham ne arz kya tha ke hamein koi wasiiyat keejiye! to aap ne farmaya ke main tumhen Allah Taala ke ahad ki (jo tum ne zimmiyon se kya hai) wasiiyat karta hun (ke uski hifazat mein kotahi na karnaa) kyonke wo tumharey Nabi ka zimma hai aur tumharey ghar walon ki rozii hai (ke jiziye ke rupye se tumharey baal-bachchon ki guzraan hoti hai)."
"3163","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ansar ko bulaayaa, taake Bahrain mein unke liye kuchh zameen likh dein. lekin unhon-ne arz kya ke nahin! Allah ki qasam! (hamein usi waqt wahan zameen inayat farmaaiye) jab itni zameen hamarey bhai Quraish (muhaajireen) ke liye bhi aap likhein. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab tak Allah ko manzoor hai ye rozi-rotii unko bhi (yani Quraish walon ko) miltii rahegii.'' lekin Ansar yahi israar kartey rahe ke Quraish walon ke liye bhi sanadein likh dijiye. jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ansar se farmaya ke mere baad tum ye dekhogey ke dusron ko tum par tarjeeh di jaeygi, lekin tum sabr se kaam lenaa, yahan tak ke tum aakhir mein mujh se aa kar milo (jang aur fasaad na karnaa)."
"3164","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya tha ke agar hamarey paas Bahrain se rupya aaya, to main tumhen itna , itna , itna ( teen lap ( doonga . phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat ho gaee aur uske baad Bahrain ka rupya aaya to Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne agar kisi se koi dene ka wada kya ho to wo hamarey paas aaey. chunanche main hazir hua aur arz kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya tha ke agar Bahrain ka rupya hamarey yahan aaya to main tumhen itnaa, itna aur itna doonga. is par unhon-ne farmaya ke achchha aik lap bharo, maine aik lap bharii, to unhon-ne farmaya ke usey gino, maine ginaa to panch so tha, phir unhon-ne mujhey dedh hazaar inayat farmaya,"
"3165","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke yahan Bahrain se khiraaj ka rupya aaya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey masjid mein phaila do, Bahrain ka wo maal un tamam amwaal mein sabse zyada tha jo ab tak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke yahan aa chukey they. itney mein Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) tashrif laey aur kehney lagey ke ya Rasulullah ! mujhey bhi inayat farmaiye (main zere-baar hon yani mujh par qarz hai) kyonke maine (badr ke mauqe par) apna bhi fidya ada kya tha aur Aqeel (Raziallahu anhu) ka bhi ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke achchha ley lijiye . chunanche unhon-ne apne kapdey mein rupya bhar liya ( lekin uthaya na ja sakaa) to usmein se kam karne lagey. lekin kam karne ke baad bhi na uth saka to arz kya ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kisi ko hukm dein ke uthaney mein meri madad karey, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aisa nahi ho sakta , unhon-ne kaha ke phir aap khud hi uthwa dein. farmaya ke ye bhi nahi ho sakta. phir Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne usmein se kuchh kam kya, lekin is par bhi na utha sakey to kaha ke kisi ko hukm dijiye ke wo utha de, farmaya ke nahi aisa nahi ho sakta, unhon-ne kaha phir aap hi utha dein, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye bhi nahi ho sakta. aakhir usmein se unhein phir kam karna padaa aur tab kahin ja ke usey apne kaandhey par utha sakey aur lekar janey lagey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt tak unhein barabar dekhtey rahe, jab tak wo hamari nazron se chhup na gaey. unke hirs par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tajjub farmaya aur aap us waqt tak wahan se na uthey jab tak wahan aik dirham bhi baqi raha."
"3166","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jisne kisi zimmii ko (naahaq) qatl kya wo jannat ki khushbu bhi na pa sakega. halanke jannat ki khushbu chalis (40) saal ki raah se soonghii ja sakti hai.''"
"3167","ham abhi masjide-Nabawi mein maujood they ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laaey, aur farmaya ke yahudiyon ki taraf chalo. chunanche ham rawaana huey aur jab baital-Midraas (yahoodiyon ka madrasa) pahunchey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke Islam lao to salamati ke sath rahogey aur samajh lo ke zameen Allah aur aur uske rasool ki hai. aur mera irada hai ke tumhen is mulk se nikal dun, phir tum mein se agar kisi ki jaaidaad ki qeemat aaey to usey bech daley. agar tum is par taiyaar nahi ho, to tumhen malum hona chahiye ke zameen Allah aur uske rasool hi ki hai."
"3168","aap ne jumerat ke din ka zikr kartey huey kaha, tumhen malum hai ke jumerat ka din , haaye ! ye kon sa din hai? iske baad wo itna roey ke unke aansuon se kankariyaan tar ho gain . Saeed ne kaha maine arz kya, ya abu-Abbaas ! jumerat ke din se kya matlab hai? unhon-ne kaha ke isi din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki takleef ( marzul-maut ( mein shiddat paida hui thi aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke mujhey ( likhney ka ( aik kaaghaz de do taake main tumharey liye aik aisi kitab likh jaun, jiske baad tum kabhi gumrah na ho. is par logon ka ikhtilaf ho gaya. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khud hi farmaya ke Nabi ki maujoodgii mein jhagadnaa ghair-munaasib hai, doosrey log kehney lagey, bhala kya Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) be-kaar baatein farmaaengey. achchha, phir poochh lo, ye sun kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mujhey meri haalat par chhod do, kyonke is waqt main jis aalim mein hun, wo us se behtar hai jiski taraf tum mujhey bula rahe ho. iske baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne teen baton ka hukm farmaya, ke mushrikon ko jazeera Arab se nikal dena aur wufood ke sath isi tarah khaatir tawaazoh ka mamla karnaa, jis tarah main kya karta tha. teesri baat kuchh bhalii si thi, ya to Saeed ne usko bayan na kya, ya mein bhool gaya. Sufiyan ne kaha ye jumla ( teesri baat kuchh bhalii si thi) Sulaiman ahwal ka kalam hai."
"3169","jab khaibar fateh hua to (yahoodiyon ki taraf se) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein bakri ka ya aisey gosht ka hadiya pesh kya gaya jis mein zahar tha. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jitney Yahudi yahan maujood hain unhein mere paas jama karo, chunanche wo sab aa gaey. iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke dekho, main tum se aik baat poochhoonga. kya tum log saheeh-saheeh jawab doge? sab ne kaha ji haan, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya, tumharey bap kon they? unhon-ne kaha ke fulaan! Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum jhoot boltey ho, tumharey bap to falan they. sab ne kaha ke aap sach farmatey hain. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, agar main tum se aik aur baat poochhoon to tum sahi waqia bayan kar doge? sab ne kaha ji haan, aey abul-Qaasim! aur agar ham jhoot bhi bolengey to aap hamari jhoot ko isi tarah pakad lengey jis tarah aap ne abhi hamarey bap ke barey mein hamarey jhoot ko pakad liya, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne iske baad malum farmaya ke dozakh mein janey waley kon log hongey? unhon-ne kaha ke kuchh dinon ke liye to ham usmein dakhil ho jaeinge lekin phir aap log hamari jagah dakhil kar diye jaengey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tum usmein barbad raho, Allah gawah hai ke ham tumhari jagah usmein kabhi dakhil nahi kiye jaengey. phir aap ne malum farmaya ke agar main tum se koi baat poochhoon to kya tum mujh se sahi waqia bata doge? is martaba bhi unhon-ne yahi kaha ke haan! aey abul-Qaasim! Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum kya ke kya tum ne us bakri ke gosht mein zahar milaya hai? unhon-ne kaha ji haan, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke tum ne aisa kyon kya? unhon-ne kaha ke hamara maqsad ye tha ke agar aap jhootey hain ( nabwooat mein) to hamein aaraam mil jaeyga aur agar aap waqei Nabi hain to ye zahar aapko koi nuqsan na pahuncha sakega."
"3170","maine Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se duaae-qunoot ke barey mein puchha to aap ne farmaya ke rukoo se pahley honii chaahiye, maine arz kya ke falan sahib (Muhammad-bin Siiriin) to kehtey hain ke aap ne kaha tha ke rukoo ke baad hoti hai, Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne is par kaha tha ke unhon-ne ghalat kaha hai. phir unhon-ne ham se ye hadis bayan ki ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik mahiney tak rukoo ke baad dua qunoot ki thi aur aap ne usmein banu-Sulaim ke qabeelon ke haq mein baddua ki thi. unhon-ne bayan kya ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chalis (40) ya 70 Quran ke aalim sahaba ki aik jamat , rawi ko shak tha, mushrekeen ke paas bheji thi, lekin banu-Sulaim ke log ( jinka sardaar Aamir-bin-Tufail tha) unke aadey aaey aur unko mar dala. halanke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se unka muaahida tha. (lekin unhon-ne daghaa di) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kisi maamle par itna ranjeeda aur ghamgeen nahi dekha jitna un sahaba ki shahadat par aap ranjeeda they."
"3171","fateh Makka ke mauqe par main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hui (Makka mein) maine dekha ke aap ghusl kar rahe they aur Fatima (Raziallahu anha) aap ki sahibzadi parda kiye huey thin. maine aapko salam kya, to aap ne malum farmaya ke kon saahiba hain? maine arz kya ke main umme-Haanii-binte-abii-Taalib hun, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, aao achi aaiin, Umme-Hani ! phir jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghusl se farigh huey to aap ne khadey ho kar aath (8) rakaat chasht ki Namaz padhi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sirf aik kapda jism at'har par lapetey huey they. maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! meri maa ke betey Ali (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey hain ke wo aik shakhs ko jisey main panah de chuki hon, qatl kiye baghair nahi rahengey. ye shakhs Hubaira ka falan ladka ( ja'ada ( hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, Umme-Hani ! jisey tum ne panah di, usey hamari taraf se bhi panah hai. Umme-Hani (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke ye waqt chasht ka tha."
"3172","Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne hamarey samney khutba diya, jis mein farmaya ke kitabullah aur us waraq mein jo kuchh hai, iske siwa aur koi kitab ( ehkaam shariiat ki) aisi hamarey paas nahi jisey ham padhtey hon, phir aap ne farmaya ke usmein zakhmon ke qisaas ke ehkaam hain aur diyat mein diye janey waley ki umr ke ehkaam hain aur ye ke Madina haram hai eir pahaadii se falan ( ahad pahaadii ( tak. isliye jis shakhs ne koi nai baat ( shariiat ke andar dakhil ki) ya kisi aisey shakhs ko panah di to is par Allah , malaaika aur insan sab ki laanat hai, na uski koi farz ibadat qabool hogi aur na nafl aur ye bayan hai jo londi ghulam apne Malik ke siwa kisi doosrey ko Malik banaey is par bhi isi tarah ( laanat ( hai. aur musalman muslmaan sab barabar hain har aik ka zimma yaksan hai. to jis shakhs ne kisi musalman ki panah mein (jo kisi kaafir ko di gaee ho ( dakhal andazi ki to is par bhi isi tarah laanat hai."
"3173","Abdullah-bin Sehal aur mahiisa bin Masood bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) khaibar gaey. un dinon ( khaibar ke yahudiyon se musalmanon ki) suleh thi. phir donon hazraat ( khaibar pahunch kar apne apney kaam ke liye) juda ho gaey. iske baad mahiisa (Raziallahu anhu) Abdullah-bin Sehal (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aaey to kya dekhtey hain ke wo khoon mein lath-path hain. kisi ne unko qatl kar daalaa, khair mahiisa (Raziallahu anhu) ne Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ko dafn kar diya. phir Madina aaey, iske baad Abdur-Rehmaan-bin-Sahal (Abdullaah (Raziallahu anhu) ke bhaaii) aur Masood ke donon sahibzadey mahiisa aur Huwesa Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey, guftgu Abdur-Rehman (Raziallahu anhu) ne shuru ki, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, ke jo tum logon mein umr mein badey hon wo baat karein. Abdur-Rehman sabse kam Umr they, wo chup ho gaey aur mahiisa aur huwesa ne baat shuru ki. aap ne malum kya, kya tum log is par qism kha saktey ho, ke jis shakhs ko tum qaatil keh rahe ho is par tumhara haq Sabit ho sakey. un logon ne arz kya ke ham aik aisey mamley mein kis tarah qism kha saktey hain jis ko ham ne khud apni aankhon se na dekha ho. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir kya yahood tumharey da'wey se apni Bara't (Tauba) apni taraf se pachaas qasmein kha karke kar dein? un logon ne arz kya ke kuffaar ki qasmon ka ham kis tarah eitibaar kar saktey hain. chunanche Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khud apne paas se unko diyat ada kar di."
"3174","Hiraql (farmaanrawaaey Rome (mojooda Itly)) ne unhein Quraish ke qafley ke sath bula bheja (ye log Sham (Syria) us zamaney mein tijarat ki gharaz se gaey huey they.) jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abu-Sufiyan se (Suleh Hudaibiya mein) Quraish ke kaafiron ke muqaddime mein suleh ki thi."
"3175","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par jaadoo kar diya gaya tha. to kuchh baar aisa hota ke aap samajhtey ke maine falan kaam kar liya hai. halanke aap ne wo kaam na kya hota."
"3176","mein jange-Tabook ke mauqe par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua, aap us waqt chamdey ke aik khemey mein tashrif farma they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, ke qiyamat ki chh nishaniyan shumaar kar lo, meri maut, phir baitul-maqdis ki fatah, phir aik wabaa jo tum mein shiddat se phailegii jaisey bakriyon mein taaoon phail jata hai. phir maal ki kasarat us darja mein hogi ke aik shakhs so Dinar bhi agar kisi ko dega to is par bhi wo naraz hoga. phir fitna itna tabah kun aam hoga ke Arab ka koi ghar baqi na rahega jo uski lapet mein na aa gaya hoga. phir suleh jo tumharey aur bani al-Asfar (Rome ke eisaaii) ke darmyan hogi, lekin wo daghaa karengey aur aik azeem lashkar ke sath tum par chadhai karengey. usmein usi jhandey hongey aur har jhandey ke ma-tehet baara hazaar fauj hogi (yani nau (9) laakh sath hazaar fauj se wo tum par hamla aawar hongey)."
"3177","Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne (hijjatul-wadaa se pahley waley Haj ke mauqe par) dasween Zil-Hijja ke din kuchh doosrey logon ke sath mujhey bhi Mina mein ye elaan karne bheja tha ke us saal ke baad koi mushrik Haj karne na aaey aur koi shakhs Baitullah ka tawaaf nangey ho kar na karey aur Haje-akbar ka din dasween taareekh Zil-Hijja ka din hai. usey Haje-Akbar isliye kaha gaya ke log ( Umra ko) Haj asghar kehney lagey they, to Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne us saal mushrikon se jo ahad liya tha usey wapas kar diya, aur doosrey saal Hijjatul-wada mein jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Haj kya to koi mushrik Sharik nahi hua."
"3178","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, char aadatein aisi hain ke agar ye charon kisi aik shakhs mein jama ho jayen to wo pakka munafiq hai. wo shakhs jo baat karey to jhoot boley, aur jab wada karey, to wada khilaafii karey, aur jab muaahida karey to usey pura na kare. aur jab kisi se ladey to gali galoch par utar aaey aur agar kisi shakhs ke andar un charon aadaton mein se aik hi aadat hai, to iske andar nifaq ki aik aadat hai jab tak ke wo usey chhod na de."
"3179","ham ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bas yahi Quran Majeed likha aur jo kuchh us waraq mein hai, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke Madina Aair pahaadii aur falan (Kudaa) pahaadii ke darmyan tak haram hai. to jisne yahan (deen mein) koi nai cheez dakhil ki ya kisi aisey shakhs ko iske hudood mein panah di to is par Allah ta'alaa, malaaika aur insan sab ki laanat hogi. na uska koi farz qabool aur na nafl qabool hoga aur musalman panah dene mein sab barabar hain. maamooli se maamooli musalman (aurat ya ghulaam) kisi kaafir ko panah de saktey hain. aur jo koi kisi musalman ka kya hua ahad tod daley is par Allah aur malaaika aur insan sab ki laanat hogi, na uski koi farz ibadat qabool hogi aur na nafl! aur jis ghulam ya londi ne apne aaqa apne Malik ki ijazat ke baghair kisi doosrey ko apna Malik bana liya, to is par Allah aur malaaika aur insan sab ki laanat hogi, na uski koi farz ibadat qabool hogi aur na nafl!"
"3180","us waqt tumhara kya haal hoga jab (jiziya aur khiraaj mein se) na tumhen dirham milega aur na Dinar ! is par kisi ne kaha, ke janab Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) aap kaisey samajhtey hain ke aisa hoga? Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha haan us zaat ki qasam! jiske hath mein Abu-Hurera ki jaan hai. ye sabsey sachey insan (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka farman hai. logon ne puchha tha ke ye kaisey ho jaeyga ? to aap ne farmaya, jabke Allah aur uske rasool ka ahad (Islaamii hukumat ghair muslimon se unki jaan w maal ki hifazat ke barey mein) todaa janey lagey, to Allah Taala bhi zimmiyon ke dilon ko sakht kar dega aur wo jiziya dena band kar dengey (balke ladney ko muste'ad hongey) ."
"3181","maine abu-Waeil se poochha, kya aap safein ki jang mein maujood they? unhon-ne bayan kya ke yahan (main tha) aur maine Sahal-bin-Haneef (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey suna tha ke tum log khud apni raey ko ghalat samjho, jo aapas mein ladtey martey ho. maine apne taiin dekha jis din abu-jandal aaya (yani Hudaibiya ke din) agar main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka hukm pher deta aur ham ne jab kisi museebat mein dar kar talwaarein apne kandhon par rakhein to wo museebat aasan ho gaee. ham ko iska anjam malum ho gaya. magar yahi aik ladai hai (jo sakht mushkil hai iska anjam behtar nahi malum hotaa)."
"3182","ham maqam safain mein derey daley huey they. phir Sahal-bin-Haneef (Raziallahu anhu) khadey huey aur farmaya aey logo ! tum khud apni raey ko ghalat samjho . ham suleh Hudaibiya ke mauqe par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they, agar hamein ladna hota to us waqt zaroor ladtey . umr (Raziallahu anhu) us mauqe par aaey (yani Hudaibiya mein) aur arz kya, ya Rasulullah! kya ham haq par aur wo baatil par nahi hain? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kyon nahin! umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha kya hamarey maqtool jannat main aur unke maqtool jahannam mein nahi jaaeinge? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, ke kyon nahin! phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke phir ham apne Deen ke mamley mein kyon dabein? kya ham (Madeena) wapas chaley jaaeinge, aur hamarey aur unke darmyan Allah koi faisla nahi karega. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''ibne-Khattaab! main Allah ka rasool hun aur Allah mujhey kabhi barbad nahi karega.'' iske baad umr (Raziallahu anhu) Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas gaey aur unse wahi sawalat kiye, jo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se abhi kar chukey they. unhon-ne bhi yahi kaha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Allah ke rasool hain, aur Allah unhein kabhi barbad nahi honey dega. phir sura fateh nazil hui aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne umr (Raziallahu anhu) ko usey aakhir tak padh kar sunaya, to umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya kya yahi fateh hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan! bila shak yahi fateh hai."
"3183","Quraish se jis zamane main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (Hudaibiya ki) suleh ki thi, usi muddat mein meri walida (Qutaila) apne bap ( Haris bin mudrik ( ko sath lekar mere paas aaein, wo Islam mein dakhil nahi hui thin. (Urwa ne bayan kya ke) Asma (Raziallahu anha) ne us barey mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha ke ya Rasulullah! meri walida aai hui hain aur mujh se raghbat ke sath milnaa chahti hain, to kya main unke sath sila rehmii karun? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan! unke sath sila rehmii kar."
"3184","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jab Umra karna chaha to aap ne Makka mein daakhile ke liye Makka ke logon se ijazat leney ke liye aadmi bhejaa. unhon-ne is shart ke sath (ijaazat di) ke Makka mein teen din se zyada qiyam na karein. hathiyar niyaam mein rakhey baghair dakhil na hon aur (Makka ke) kisi aadmi ko apne sath (Madina ( na ley jayen ( agarche wo jana chahey ( unhon-ne bayan kya ke phir un sharaait ko Ali-bin abi-Talib (Raziallahu anhu) ne likhnaa shuru kya aur is tarah ''ye Muhammad Allah ke rasool ke suleh naamaa ki tahreer hai.'' Makka walon ne kaha ke agar ham jaan letey ke aap Allah ke rasool hain to phir aapko roktey hi nahi balke aap par eman latey , isliye tumhen yun likhnaa chahiye, ''ye Muhammad-bin-Abdullah ki suleh naamaa ki tahreer hai''. is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, Allah gawah hai ke main Muhammad-bin-Abdullah hun aur Allah gawah hai ke main Allah ka rasool bhi hun. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) likhnaa nahi jantey they. rawi ne bayan kya ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaya ke Rasulullah ka lafz mitaa de. Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya ke Allah ki qism ! ye lafz to main kabhi na mitaaoonga, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir mujhey dikhlaao , rawi ne bayan kya ke Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko wo lafz dikhaya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khud apne hath se usey mitaa diya. phir jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Makka tashrif le gaey aur (teen) din guzar gaey to Quraish Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aaey aur kaha ke ab apne sathi se kaho ke ab yahan se chaley jayen ( Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke) maine iska zikr Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya to aap ne farmaya ke haan, chunanche aap wahan se rawaana ho gaey."
"3185","Makka main ( shuru Islam ke zamane main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sajde ki haalat mein they aur qareeb hi Quraish ke kuchh log baithey huey they. phir Aqba-bin-abii-Mueet oont ki ojhdii laya aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki peeth par usey daal diya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sajde se apna sar na utha sakey. aakhir Fatima (Raziallahu anha) aaein aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki peeth par se us ojhdii ko hataya aur jisne ye harkat ki thi usey bura bhala kaha, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bhi baddua ki ke aey Allah ! Quraish ki is jamat ko pakad. aey Allaah! abu-Jahal bin Hisham , Utba-bin- Rabee , Sheba-bin-Rabee'a, Aqba-bin-abii-Mueet, Umayya-bin-Khalaf ya Ubai-bin Khalaf ko barbad kar. phir maine dekha ke ye sab badr ki ladai mein qatl kar diye gaey aur aik kuwein mein unhein daal diya gaya tha. siwa Umayya ya Ubaii ke ke ye shakhs bahut bhari bhar kam tha. jab usey sahaba ne kheenchaa to kuwein mein dalney se pahley hi iske jod jod alag ho gaey."
"3186","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''qiyaamat ke din har daghaa baaz ke liye aik jhanda hoga, unmein se aik sahib ne bayan kya ke wo jhanda (iske peechhey ( gaad diya jaeyga aur doosrey sahib ne bayan kya ke usey qiyamat ke din sab dekhengey, iske zariey usey pehchaana jaaeyga.''"
"3187","nabii Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''qiyaamat ke din har daghaa baaz ke liye aik jhanda hoga, unmein se aik sahib ne bayan kya ke wo jhanda (iske peechhey ( gaad diya jaeyga aur doosrey sahib ne bayan kya ke usey qiyamat ke din sab dekhengey, iske zariey usey pehchaana jaaeyga.''"
"3190","bani Tameem ke kuchh log Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aaey to aap ne unse farmaya ke aey bani Tameem ke logo ! tumhen bashaarat ho. wo kehney lagey ke bashaarat jab aap ne ham ko di hai to ab hamein kuchh maal bhi dijiye. is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke chehra Mubarak ka rang badal gaya, phir aap ki khidmat mein Yaman ke log aaey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse bhi farmaya ke aey Yaman waalo! banu- Tameem ke logon ne to khushkhabri ko qabool nahi kya, ab tum usey qabool kar lo. unhon-ne arz kya ke ham ne qabool kya. phir aap makhlooq aur arshe-Ilaahii ki shuruaat ke barey mein guftgu farmaney lagey. itney mein aik (naa-maaloom) shakhs aaya aur kaha ke Imraan! tumhari ontni bhag gaee. (Imraan (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey hain) kaash, main aap ki majlis se na uthtaa to behtar hota."
"3191","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur apne oont ko maine darwazey hi par baandh diya. iske baad banii-Tameem ke kuchh log aap ki khidmat mein hazir huey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ''aey banu- Tameem ! khushkhabri qabool karo.'' unhon-ne do baar kaha ke jab aap ne hamein khushkhabri di hai to ab maal bhi dijiye. phir Yaman ke chand log khidmate-nabawii mein hazir huey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse bhi yahi farmaya ke khushkhabri qabool kar lo aey Yaman waalo! banu- Tameem walon ne to nahi qabool ki. wo boley : ya Rasulullah ! khushkhabri ham ne qabool ki. phir wo kehney lagey ham isliye hazir huey hain taake aap se us (aalim ki paidaaish) ka haal poochhein . Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala hameshaa se maujood tha aur uske siwa koi cheez maujood na thi aur uska arsh pani par tha. lauhe-mahfooz mein us ne har cheez ko likh liya tha. phir Allah Taala ne aasman w zameen ko paida kya.'' (abhii ye baatein ho hi rahi thin ke) aik pukarney waley ne awaz di ke ibne-Husain! tumhari ontni bhag gaee. mein iske peechhey douda. dekha to wo saraab ki aad mein hai (mere aur uske beech mein saraab haail hai yani wo retii jo dhoop mein pani ki tarah chamaktii hai) Allah Taala ki qasam, mera dil bahut pachhtaayaa ke kaash, maine usey chhod diya hota (aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki hadis suni hotii)."
"3192","aik martaba Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne member par khadey ho kar hamein waz (nasihat) farmaya aur khalq ki paidaaish ke barey mein hamein khabar di. yahan tak ke jab jannat waley apni manzilon mein dakhil ho jaeinge aur jahannam waley apne thikaanon ko pahunch jaeinge ( wahan tak saari tafseel ko aap ne bayan farmaya) jisey is hadis ko yad rakhna tha us ne yad rakha aur jisey bhoolnaa tha wo bhool gaya."
"3193","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala farmata hai ke ibne-Aadam ne mujhey gali di aur uske liye munasib na tha ke wo mujhey gali detaa. usne mujhey jhutlaayaa aur uske liye ye bhi munasib na tha. uski gali ye hai ke wo kehta hai, mera betaa hai aur uska jhutlana ye hai ke wo kehta hai ke jis tarah Allah ne mujhey pehli baar paida kya, dobara ( maut ke baad) wo mujhey zinda nahi kar sakega."
"3194","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' jab Allah Taala makhlooq ko paida kar chuka to apni kitab (lauhe-mahfooz) mein, jo uske paas arsh par maujood hai, us ne likha ke meri rehmat mere ghusse par ghalib hai.''"
"3195","unka aik doosrey sahib se aik zameen ke barey mein jhagdaa tha. wo Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur unse waqia bayan kya. unhon-ne ( jawab mein) farmaya : abu-Salma ! kisi ki zameen (ke nahaq leney ( se bacho , kyonke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya hai ke agar aik baalisht ke barabar bhi kisi ne ( zameen ke barey mein) zulm kya to (qiyamat ke din) sath zameenon ka tauq usey pahnaayaa jaeyga"
"3196","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jisne kisi ki zameen mein se kuchh nahaq ley liya to qiyamat ke din usey saat (7) zameenon tak dhansaayaa jaaeyga.''"
"3197","ham se Muhammad-bin Sirin ne bayan kya, unse Abu-Bakra ke sahibzadey (Abdur-Rehmaan) ne bayan kya aur unse Abu-Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''zamaana ghoom phir kar usi haalat par aa gaya jaisey us din tha jis din Allah Taala ne aasman aur zameen paida ki thi. saal baara mahinon ka hota hai, char mahiney usmein se hurmat ke hain. teen to pai-dar-pai . Zi-Qada , Zil-Hijja aur Mohrim aur (chauthaa) Rajab Muzar jo Jumaadal-ukhraa aur Shoban ke beech mein padta hai.''"
"3198","Arwaa-binte-abii-Aos se unka aik ( zameen ke) barey mein jhagdaa hua. jiske mutaalliq Arwa kehti thi ke Saeed ne meri zameen chheen li. ye muqaddima Marwan khaleefa ke yahan faisla ke liye gaya jo Madina ka Hakim tha. Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha bhala kya main unka haq daba loonga, mein gawahi deta hun ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey suna hai ke jisne aik baalisht zameen bhi zulm se kisi ki daba li to qiyamat ke din saaton zameenon ka tauq uski gardan mein daala jaeyga ibne- abii-Zinaad ne bayan kya, unse Hisham ne, unse unke walid ne bayan kya, aur unse Saeed bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein maujood they ( tab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye hadis bayan farmai thi)."
"3199","Nabii Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jab suraj ghurub hua to unse puchha ke tum ko malum hai ye suraj kahan jata hai? maine kaha ke Allah aur uske rasool hi ko ilm hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye jata hai aur arsh ke nichey pahunch kar pahley sajda karta hai. phir (dobaara aaney) ki ijazat chahta hai aur usey ijazat di jati hai aur wo din bhi qareeb hai, jab ye sajda karega to uska sajda qabool na hoga aur ijazat chaahega lekin ijazat na milegii. balke us se kaha jaeyga ke jahan se aaya tha wahin wapas chala jaa. chunanche us din wo maghrib hi se niklega. Allah Taala ke farman ( والشمس تجري لمستقر لها ذلك تقدير العزيز العليم ( ) یٰسٓ : 38 ( mein usi taraf ishara hai."
"3200","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''qiyaamat ke din suraj aur chaand donon taareek (be noor (ho jaaengey.''"
"3201","wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se naql kartey they ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke suraj aur chaand mein kisi ki maut w hayaat ki wjah se girahan nahi lagtaa. balke ye Allah Taala ki nishaniyon mein se aik nishani hain. isliye jab tum unko dekho to Namaz padha karo."
"3202","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''sooraj aur chaand Allah Taala ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain kisi ki maut w hayaat se unmein girahan nahi lagta . isliye jab tum girahan dekho to Allah ki yad mein lag jaya karo.''"
"3203","jis din suraj girahan laga to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ( musalley par) khadey huey. ( Allahu-akbar ( kaha aur badi der tak qirat kartey rahe. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne rukoo kya, aik bahut lamba rukoo', phir sar utha kar) سمع الله لمن حمده ( kaha aur pahley ki tarah khadey ho gaey. us qiyam mein bhi lambi qirat ki. halaanki pehli qirat se kam thi aur phir rukoo mein chaley gaey aur der tak rukoo mein rahe, halaanki pahley rukoo se ye kam tha. iske baad sajda kya, aik lamba sajda , dusri rakaat mein bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne isi tarah kya aur uske baad salam phera to suraj saaf ho chuka tha. ab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sahaba ko khitab farmaya aur suraj aur chaand girahan ke mutaalliq batlaya ke ye Allah Taala ki nishaniyon mein se nishani hain aur unmein kisi ki maut w hayaat ki wjah se girahan nahi lagtaa, isliye jab tum girahan dekho to fauran Namaz ki taraf lapak jao ."
"3204","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' suraj aur chaand mein kisi ki maut ya hayaat par girahan nahi lagtaa. balke ye Allah ki nishaniyon mein se nishani hain isliye jab tum unmein girahan dekho to Namaz padho.''"
"3205","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''mashriqii hawa ke zariey meri madad ki gaee aur qaume-aad maghribii hawa se halaak kar di gaee thii.''"
"3206","jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) abr ka koi aisa tukda dekhtey jis se barish ki ummeed hoti to aap kabhi aagey aatey, kabhi peechhey jatey, kabhi ghar ke andar tashrif latey, kabhi bahar aa jatey aur chehra Mubarak ka rang badal jata. lekin jab barish honey lagti to phir ye kaifiyat baqi na rahtii. aik martaba Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne iske mutaalliq aap se poochha. to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, main nahi janta mumkin hai ye badal bhi waisaa hi ho jiske barey mein qaume-aad ne kaha tha, jab unhon-ne badal ko apni wadiyon ki taraf aatey dekha tha. aakhir aayat tak (ke unke liye rehmat ka badal aaya hai, halanke wo azab ka badal thaa)."
"3207","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''main aik baar Baitullah ke qareeb neend aur bedaarii ki darmyani haalat mein tha, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne 2 aadmiyon ke darmyan letey huey aik teesrey aadmi ka zikr farmaya, iske baad mere paas soney ka aik tasht laya gaya, jo hikmat aur eman se bharpur tha. mere seeney ko pet ke aakhiri hissey tak chaak kiya gaya. phir mera pet zamzam ke pani se dhoya gaya aur usey hikmat aur eman se bhar diya gaya. iske baad mere paas aik sawari laai gaee. safaid, khachchar se chhoti aur gadhey se badi yani burraaq, main is par Sawar ho kar Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ke sath chalaa. jab ham aasmaane-duniyaa par pahunchey to puchha gaya ke ye kon sahib hain? unhon-ne kaha ke Jibraaiil. puchha gaya ke aap ke sath aur kon sahib aaey hain? unhon-ne bataya ke Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) puchha gaya ke kya unhein bulaney ke liye aapko bheja gaya tha? unhon-ne kaha ke haan, is par jawab aaya ke achi kushaada jagah aaney waley kya hi Mubarak hain, phir main Adam (Alaihissalam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur unhein salam kya. unhon-ne farmaya, aao piyarey betey aur achchhey Nabi . iske baad ham doosrey aasman par pahunchey yahan bhi wahi sawal hua. kon sahib hain? kaha Jibraeel, sawal hua, aap ke sath koi aur sahib bhi aaey hain? kaha ke Muhammad (sl), sawal hua unhein bulaney ke liye aapko bheja gaya tha? kaha ke haan. ab idhar se jawab aaya, achi kushaada jagah aaey hain, aaney waley kya hi Mubarak hain. iske baad mein Esa aur Yahya (Alaihissalam) se mila, un hazraat ne bhi khush aamadeed, marhaba kaha apne bhai aur Nabi ko . phir ham teesrey aasman par aaey yahan bhi sawal hua kon sahib hain? jawab mila Jibraaiil. sawal hua, aap ke sath bhi koi hai? kaha ke Muhammad (sl), sawal hua, unhein bulaney ke liye aapko bheja gaya tha? unhon-ne bataya ke yahaan, ab awaz aai achi kushaada jagah aaey aaney waley kya hi Saleh hain, yahan Yusuf (Alaihissalam) se main mila aur unhein salam kya, unhon-ne farmaya, achi kushaada jagah aaey ho mere bhai aur nabii, yahan se ham chauthey aasman par aaey is par bhi yahi sawal hua, kon saahib, jawab diya ke Jibraeel, sawal hua, aap ke sath aur kon sahib hain? kaha ke Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hain. puchha kya unhein laney ke liye aapko bheja gaya tha? jawab diya ke haan. phir awaz aaii, achi kushaada jagah aaey kya hi achchhey aaney waley hain. yahan mein Idrees (Alaihissalam) se mila aur salam kya, unhon-ne farmaya, marhabaa, bhai aur nabii. yahan se ham paanchwein aasman par aaey. yahan bhi sawal hua ke kon saahib? jawab diya ke Jibraeel, puchha gaya aur aap ke sath aur kon sahib aaey hain? jawab diya ke Muhammad (sl). puchha gaya, unhein bulaney ke liye bheja gaya tha? kaha ke haan, awaz aaii, achi kushaada jagah aaey hain. aaney waley kya hi achchhey hain. yahan ham Harun (Alaihissalam) se miley aur maine unhein salam kya. unhon-ne farmaya, Mubarak mere bhai aur nabii. tum achi kushaada jagah aaey, yahan se ham chhatey aasman par aaey, yahan bhi sawal hua, kon saahib? jawab diya ke Jibraeel, puchha gaya, aap ke sath aur bhi koi hain? kaha ke haan. Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hain. puchha gayaa: kya unhein bulaya gaya tha kaha haan, kaha achi kushaada jagah aaey hain, achchhey aaney waley hain. yahan main Musa (Alaihissalam) se mila aur unhein salam kya. unhon-ne farmaya, mere bhai aur Nabi achi kushaada jagah aaey, jab main wahan se aagey badhney laga to wo roney lagey kisi ne puchha buzurgwaar aap kyon ro rahe hain? unhon-ne farmaya ke aey Allaah! ye naujawaan jisey mere baad nabwooat di gaee, uski ummat mein se jannat mein dakhil honey waale, meri ummat ke jannat mein dakhil hone-waale logon se zyada hongey. iske baad ham saatwein aasman par aaey yahan bhi sawal hua ke kon sahib hain? jawab diya ke Jibraeel, sawal hua ke koi sahib aap ke sath bhi hain? jawab diya ke Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) poochha, unhein bulaney ke liye aapko bheja gaya tha? marhabaa, achchhey aaney waale. yahan main Ibrahim se mila aur unhein salam kya. unhon-ne farmaya mere betey aur nabii, mubaarak! achi kushaada jagah aaey ho, iske baad mujhey baitul-ma'moor dikhaya gaya. maine Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) se iske barey mein poochha, to unhon-ne batlaya ke ye baitul-ma'moor hai. ismein 70 hazaar Farishtey rozaana Namaz padhtey hain. aur aik martaba padh kar jo us se nikal jata hai to phir kabhi dakhil nahi hota aur mujhey Sidratul-Muntahaa bhi dikhaya gaya, iske phal aisey they jaisey maqam hijr ke matkey hotey hain aur pattey aisey they jaisey haathii ke kaan, uski jad se char nehrein nikalti thin, 2 nehrein to baatinii thin aur 2 zaahirii, maine Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) se puchha to unhon-ne bataya ke jo 2 baatinii nehrein hain wo to jannat mein hain aur 2 zahiri nehrein duniya mein neel aur Furaat hain. iske baad mujh par pachaas waqt ki namazein farz ki gaiin. main jab wapas hua aur Musa (Alaihissalam) se mila to unhon-ne puchha ke kya karke aaey ho? maine arz kya ke pachaas namazein mujh par farz ki gaee hain. unhon-ne farmaya ke insanon ko main tum se zyada janta hun, Bani-Israeel ka mujhey bura tajriba ho chuka hai. tumhari ummat bhi itni namazon ki taqat nahi rakhtii. isliye apne rab ki bargah mein dobara haziri do, aur kuchh kami ki darkhaast karo, main wapas hua to Allah Taala ne namazein chalis (40) waqt ki kar din. phir bhi Musa (Alaihissalam) apni baat (yani kami karaaney) par adey rahe. is martaba tees waqt ki reh gaiin. phir unhon-ne wahi farmaya aur is martaba baargaahe-rabbul-izzat mein meri darkhaast ki peshii par Allah Taala ne unhein das kar diya. main jab Musa (Alaihissalam) ke paas aaya to ab bhi unhon-ne kam karaaney ke liye apna israar jari rakha aur is martaba Allah Taala ne panch waqt ki kar din. ab Musa (Alaihissalam) se mila, to unhon-ne phir malum farmaya ke kya hua? maine kaha ke Allah Taala ne panch kar di hain. is martaba bhi unhon-ne kam karaaney ka israar kya. maine kaha ke ab to main Allah ke sipurd kar chukaa. phir awaz aai. maine apna fareeza (panch namazon ka ( jari kar diya. apne bandon par kami kar chuka aur main aik neki ka badla das guna deta hun aur Hammam ne kaha, unse Qatada ne kaha, unse Hasan ne, unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se baitul-ma'moo ke barey mein alag riwayat ki hai."
"3208","ham se sabsey sachey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bayan farmaya aur farmaya ke tumhari paidaaish ki taiyaarii tumhari maa ke pet mein chalis (40) dinon tak (nutfe ki soorat) mein ki jati hai itni hi dinon tak phir aik basta khoon ke sura mein ikhtiyar kiye rehta hai aur phir wo itney hi dinon tak aik muzgha gosht rehta hai. iske baad Allah Taala aik farishta bhejta hai aur usey char baton (ke likhney) ka hukm deta hai. us se kaha jata hai ke uska amal, uska rizq , uski muddate-zindagii aur ye ke bad hai ya nek, likh ley. ab us nutfe mein Rooh dali jati hai (yaad rakh) aik shakhs (zindagii bhar nek) amal karta rehta hai aur jab jannat aur uske darmyan sirf aik hath ka fasla reh jata hai to uski taqdeer samney aa jati hai aur dozakh walon ke amal shuru kar deta hai. isi tarah aik shakhs (zindagii bhar burey) kaam karta rehta hai aur jab dozakh aur uske darmyan sirf aik hath ka fasla reh jata hai to uski taqdeer ghalib aa jati hai aur jannat walon ke kaam shuru kar deta hai."
"3209","Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya aur is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) abu-Aasim ne ibne-Juraij se ki hai ke mujhey Musa-bin-Aqba ne khabar di unhein Naafe ne aur unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab Allah Taala kisi bandey se mohabbat karta hai to Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) se farmata hai ke Allah Taala falan shakhs se mohabbat karta hai. tum bhi us se mohabbat rakho, chunanche Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) bhi us se mohabbat rakhney lagtey hain. phir Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) tamam ahale-aasmaan ko pukar detey hain ke Allah Taala falan shakhs se mohabbat rakhta hai. isliye tum sab log us se mohabbat rakho, chunanche tamam aasman waley us se mohabbat rakhney lagtey hain. iske baad poori zameen waley bhi usko maqbool samajhtey hain."
"3210","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ''farishtey ( عنان ( mein utartey hain. aur) عنان ( se murad badal hain. yahan Farishtey un kaamon ka zikr kartey hain jinka faisla aasman mein ho chuka hota hai. aur yahin se shayatin kuchh chori chhipey baatein uda letey hain. phir kaahinon ko uski khabar kar detey hain aur ye kaahin so jhoot apni taraf se mila kar usey bayan kartey hain.''"
"3211","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab Juma ka din aata hai to masjid ke har darwazey par Farishtey khadey ho jatey hain aur sabse pahley aaney waley aur phir uske baad aaney walon ko number waar likhtey jatey hain. phir jab imam ( khutbey ke liye member par) baith jata hai to ye Farishtey apne rajister band kar letey hain aur zikr sunney lag jatey hain.''"
"3212","umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) masjid mein tashrif laey to Hassan (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main us waqt yahan sher padha karta tha jab aap se behtar shakhs (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam)) yahan tashrif rakhtey they. phir Hassan (rz), Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf mutwajjeh huey aur kaha ke main tum se Allah ka waasta de kar poochhta ho kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey tum ne nahi suna tha ke aey Hassan! (kuffaare-Makka ko) meri taraf se jawab de. aey Allaah! roohul-qudus ke zariey Hassan ki madad kar. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke haan, beshak (maine suna tha) ."
"3213","ham se Hafs bin umr ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Shoba ne bayan kya, unse Adii-bin Sabit ne aur unse Bara-bin-Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hassan (Raziallahu anhu) se Farmaya ki mushrikon ki tum bhi tauheen karo (ya ye farmaaya) unki tauheen ka jawab do, jibreel (Alaihissalam) tumharey sath hain."
"3214","jaisey wo ghubaar meri nazron ke samney hai. Musa ne riwayat mein yun zyadti ki ke Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ke) sath aaney waale) sawar farishton ki wjah se. jo ghubaar khandan banu-ghanam ki gali se utha tha."
"3215","Haris-bin-Hisham (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha ke wahi aap ke paas kis tarah aati hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kai tarah se aati hai. kabhi farishta ke zariey aati hai to wo ghanti bajney ki awaz ki tarah nazil hoti hai. jab wahi khatm ho jati hai to jo kuchh Farishtey ne nazil kya hota hai, main usey poori tarah yad kar chuka hota hun. wahi utarney ki ye sura mere liye bahut dushwar hoti hai. kabhi farishta mere samney aik mard ki sura mein aa jata hai wo mujh se baatein karta hai aur jo kuchh keh jata hai main usey poori tarah yad kar leta hun."
"3216","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farma rahe they ke Allah ke rastey mein jo shakhs kisi cheez ka bhi joda de, to jannat ke chaukeedaar Farishtey usey bulaaengey ke falan us darwazey se andar aa ja Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne is par kaha ke ye to wo shakhs hoga jisey koi nuqsan na hoga. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mujhey ummeed hai ke to bhi unhiin mein se hoga."
"3217","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik martaba farmaya ''aey Aaisha! ye Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) aaey hain, tum ko salam keh rahe hain.'' Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne jawab mein kaha, ke Waalekumassalaam warahmatullahi wabarkaatuh. aap wo cheezein dekhtey hain jinhein main nahi dekh saktii, Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki murad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se thi."
"3218","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) se aik martaba farmaya ''ham se mulaqat ke liye jitni martaba aap aatey hain us se zyada kyon nahi aatey? ''bayaan kya ke is par ye aayat nazil hui ( وما نتنزل إلا بأمر ربك له ما بين أيدينا وما خلفنا‏ ( ''aur ham nahi utartey lekin terey rab ke hukm se, usi ka hai jo kuchh ke hamarey samney hai aur jo kuchh hamarey peechhey hai.'' aakhir aayat tak."
"3219","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ne Quran Majeed mujhey ( Arab ke) aik hi muhaawrey ke mutabiq padh kar sikhaya tha, lekin main usmein barabar izaafe ki khahish ka izhar karta raha, yahan tak ke Arab ke saat (7) muhaawaron par iska nuzool hua.''"
"3220","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sabse zyada data they aur aap ki sakhawat Ramazan sharif ke mahiney main aur badh jaatii, jab Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) aap se mulaqat ke liye har roz aaney lagtey. Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Ramazan ki har raat mein mulaqat ke liye aatey aur aap se Quran ka daur kya kartey they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khususan us daur mein jab Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) rozaana aap se mulaqat ke liye aatey to aap khairat w barkaat mein tez chalney wali hawa se bhi zyada data ho jatey they aur Abdullah-bin-Mubarak se riwayat hai, unse Mamar ne isi asnaad ke sath isi tarah bayan kya aur Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) aur Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ne naql kya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ke Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Quran Majeed ka daur kya kartey they."
"3221","unse ibne-Shahab ne Umar-bin-abdul-Azeez (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne aik din Asr ki Namaz kuchh der karke padhai. is par Urwa-bin-Zubair (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne unse kaha, lekin Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) (namaz ka tariqa Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko sikhaney ke liye) nazil huey aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke aagey ho kar aapko Namaz padhai. Umar-bin Abdul-Azeez ne kaha, Urwa! aapko malum bhi hai aap kya keh rahe hain? Urwa ne kaha ke (aur sun lo ( maine Basheer-bin-abii- Masood se suna aur unhon-ne Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne bayan kya ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farma rahe they ke Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) nazil huey aur unhon-ne mujhey Namaz padhai. maine unke sath Namaz padhi, phir (doosrey waqt ki) unke sath maine Namaz padhi, phir unke sath maine Namaz padhi, phir maine unke sath Namaz padhi, phir maine unke sath Namaz padhi, apni ungliyon par aap ne panchon namazon ko gin kar bataya."
"3222","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Jibraaiil (Alaihissalam) keh gaey hain ke tumhari ummat ka jo aadmi is haalat mein mareyga ke wo Allah Taala ke sath kisi ko Sharik na thahraataa raha hoga, to wo jannat mein dakhil hoga ya (aap ne ye farmaya ke) jahannam mein dakhil nahi hoga. chahe us ne apni zindagi mein zina kya ho, chahe chori ki ho, aur chahe zina aur chori karta ho.''"
"3223","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Farishtey aagey peechhey zameen par aatey jatey rahtey hain, kuchh Farishtey raat ke hain aur kuchh din ke aur ye sab fajr aur Asr ki Namaz mein jama ho jatey hain. phir wo Farishtey jo tumharey yahan raat mein rahe. Allah ke huzoor mein jatey hain, Allah Taala unse malum farmata hai. . . . halanke wo sabse zyada jaanney wala hai. . . . ke tum ne mere bandon ko kis haal mein chhodaa, wo Farishtey arz kartey hain ke jab ham ne unhein chhoda to wo (fajr ki) Namaz padh rahe they. aur isi tarah jab ham unke yahan gaey they, jab bhi wo (asr ( ki Namaz padh rahe they."
"3224","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye aik takiya bharaa, jis par tasweerein bani hui thin. wo aisa ho gaya jaisey naqshii takiya hota hai. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey to darwazey par khadey ho gaey aur aap ke chehrey ka rang badalney laga. maine arz kya, ya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ! ham se kya ghalati huii? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye takiya kaisa hai? maine arz kya, ye to maine aap ke liye banaya hai taake aap is par tek laga sakein. is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, kya tumhen nahi malum ke Farishtey us ghar mein dakhil nahi hotey jis mein koi tasweer hoti hai aur ye ke jo shakhs bhi tasweer banaaeyga, qiyamat ke din usey is par azab diya jaeyga us se kaha jaeyga ke jiski moorat tu ney banaaii, ab usey zinda bhi karke dikhaa."
"3225","maine abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo kehtey they ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''farishtey us ghar mein dakhil nahi hotey jis mein kuttey hon aur is mein bhi nahi jis mein jaandaar ki tasweer ho.''"
"3226","aur (raawii hadis) Basar-bin-Saeed ke sath Ubaidullah Kholani bhi riwayat hadis mein Sharik hain, jo ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi Memuna (Raziallahu anha) ki parwarish mein they. un donon se Zaid-bin-Khalid Johni (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke unse abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''farishtey us ghar mein nahi dakhil hotey jis main ( jaandaar ki) tasweer ho.'' Basar ne bayan kya ke phir Zaid-bin-Khalid (Raziallahu anhu) bimar padey aur ham unki iyaadat ke liye unke ghar gaey. ghar mein aik parda padaa hua tha aur is par tasweerein bani hui thin. maine Ubaidullah Kholani se kaha, kya unhon-ne ham se tasweeron ke mutaalliq aik hadis nahi bayan ki thi? unhon-ne bataya ke Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) ne ye bhi kaha tha ke kapdey par agar naqsh w nigaar hon (jaandaar ki tasweer na ho) to wo us hukm se alag hai. kya aap ne hadis ka ye hissey nahi suna tha? maine kaha ke nahi. unhon-ne bataya ke ji haan! Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) ne ye bhi bayan kya tha."
"3227","aik martaba Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ne aaney ka wada kya tha (lekin nahi aaey) phir jab aaey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse wjah poochhii, unhon-ne kaha ke ham kisi bhi aisey ghar mein dakhil nahi hotey jis mein tasweer ya kutta maujood ho."
"3228","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab (namaz mein) imam kahey ke) سمع الله لمن حمده ( to tum kaha karo) اللهم ربنا لك الحمد ( kyonke jiska zikr malaaika ke sath muwafiq ho jata hai iske pichhley gunah maaf ho jatey hain.''"
"3229","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''koii shakhs Namaz ki wjah se jab tak kahin thehra rahega uska ye Sara waqt Namaz mein shumaar hoga aur malaaika uske liye ye dua kartey rahengey ke aey Allaah! uski maghfirat farma, aur is par apni rehmat nazil kar (us waqt tak) jab tak wo Namaz se farigh ho kar apni jagah se uth na jaey ya baat na kare.''"
"3230","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap member par sura Zukhruf ki is aayat ki tilawat farma rahe they ( ونادوا ya مالك‏ (aur wo dozakhi pukaarengey aey Maalik! (ye darogha jahannam ka naam hai) aur Sufiyan ne kaha ke Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ki raat mein yun hai ونادوا ya مال."
"3231","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha, kya aap par koi din Uhud ke din se bhi zyada sakht guzra hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke tumhari qaum ( Quraish ( ki taraf se maine kitni museebatein uthai hain lekin us sarey daur mein Aqba ka din mujh par sabse zyada sakht tha ye wo mauqa tha jab maine (taaif ke sardaar) kinaana bin abd ya Lail bin abd kalaal ke yahan apne aapko pesh kya tha. lekin us ne (Islam ko qabool nahi kya aur (meri dawat ko radd kar diya. main wahan se intihai ranjeeda ho kar wapas hua. phir jab main Qarnus-Sa'alib pahuncha, tab mujh ko kuchh hosh aaya, maine apna sar uthaya to kya dekhta hun ke badli ka aik tukda mere uper saaya kiye huey hai aur maine dekha ke Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) usmein maujood hain, unhon-ne mujhey awaz di aur kaha ke Allah Taala aap ke barey mein aap ki qaum ki baatein sun chuka aur jo unhon-ne radd kya hai wo bhi sun chuka . aap ke paas Allah Taala ne pahadon ka farishta bheja hai, aap unke barey mein jo chaahein iska usey hukm de dein. iske baad mujhey pahadon ke Farishtey ne awaz di, unhon-ne mujhey salam kya aur kaha ke aey Muhammad (sl)! phir unhon-ne bhi wahi baat kahii, aap jo chaahein (iska mujhey hukm farmaaein) agar aap chaahein to main donon taraf ke pahaad un par la kar mila dun (jin se wo chaknaa-choor ho jaaein) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, mujhey to uski ummeed hai ke Allah Taala unki nasl se aisi aulad paida karega jo akeley Allah ki ibadat karegii, aur uske sath kisi ko Sharik na thahraaegii."
"3232","maine zar-bin-habeesh se Allah Taala ke (sura Najm mein) irshaad فكان قاب قوسين أو أدنى * فأوحى إلى عبده ما أوحىke mutaalliq poochha, to unhon-ne bayan kya ke ham se ibne-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya tha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ko (apni aslii sura mein) dekha, to unke chh so bazu they."
"3233","( Allah Taala ke irshad ( ) لقد رأى من آيات ربه الكبرى‏ (ke mutaalliq batlaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik sabz rang ka bichhonaa dekha tha jo aasman mein sarey kinaron ko gherey huey tha."
"3234","jisne ye guman kya ke Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne rab ko dekha tha to usne badi jhooti baat zaban se nikaalii , lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ko) meraaj ki raat mein) unki asl sura mein dekha tha. unke wujood ne aasman ka kinara dhanp liya tha."
"3235","maine Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se puchha (unke us kehney par ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Allah Taala ko dekha nahi tha) phir Allah Taala ke us irshaad ثم دنا فتدلى * فكان قاب قوسين أو أدنىke barey mein aap ka kya khayal hai? unhon-ne kaha ke ye aayat to Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ke barey mein hai, wo insani shakl main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya kartey they aur us martaba apni us shakl mein aaey jo aslii thi aur unhon-ne tamam aasman ke kinaron ko dhanp liya tha."
"3236","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' maine aaj raat ( khuwab mein) dekha ke 2 log mere paas aaey. un donon ne mujhey bataya ke wo jo aag jalaa raha hai. wo jahannam ka darogha Malik naam ke farishta hai. main Jibraeel hun aur ye Mikaail hain.''"
"3237","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''agar kisi mard ne apni biwi ko apne bistar par bulaayaa, lekin us ne aaney se inkar kar diya aur mard is par ghussa ho kar so gaya, to subah tak Farishtey us aurat par laanat kartey rahtey hain.'' is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) , abu-Hamza , ibne- Dawud aur abu-Muawia ne Aamash ke waaste se ki hai."
"3238","(pahley ghaar hira mein jo Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) mujh ko sura Iqra padha kar gaey they uske baad) mujh par wahi ka nuzool ( teen saal ( band raha. aik baar mein kahin ja raha tha ke maine aasman mein se aik awaz suni aur nazar aasman ki taraf uthai , maine dekha ke wahi farishta jo ghare-hira mein mere paas aaya tha (yani Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ( aasman aur zameen ke darmyan aik kursi par betha hua hai. main unhein dekh kar itna dar gaya ke zameen par gir padaa. phir main apne ghar aaya aur kehney laga ke mujhey kuchh odha do, mujhey kuchh odha do. iske baad Allah Taala ne ye aayat nazil farmai .) ya أيها المدثر‏ ( Allah Taala ke irshad ( فاهجر‏ ( tak. abu-Salma ne kaha ke aayat main ( الرجز ( se but murad hain."
"3239","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Mea'raaj mein, maine Musa (Alaihissalam) ko dekha tha, gehunwey rang, qad lamba aur baal ghunghraaley they, aisey lagtey they jaisey qabila shanooh ka koi shakhs ho aur maine Esa (Alaihissalam) ko bhi dekha tha. darmyaana qad, darmiyaanaa jism , rang surkhi aur safedi liye huey aur sar ke baal seedhey they (yani ghunghraaley nahi they) aur maine jahannam ke darogha ko bhi dekha aur dajjal ko bhi, minjumla un aayatein ke jo Allah Taala ne mujh ko dikhai thin (Sura Sajda mein isi ka zikr hai ke) to (aey Nabi !) unse mulaqat ke barey mein aap kisi qism ka shak w shuba na karein, yani Musa (Alaihissalam) se milney mein, Anas aur Abu-Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se yun bayan kya ke jab dajjal niklega to Farishtey dajjal se Madina ki hifazat karengey."
"3240","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab koi shakhs martaa hai to (rozaana) subah w Sham donon waqt iska thikana ( jahan wo aakhirat mein rahega ( usey dikhlaaya jata hai. agar wo jannati hai to jannat mein agar wo dozakhi hai to dozakh mein.''"
"3241","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''maine jannat mein jhank kar dekha to jannatiyon mein zyadti ghareebon ki nazar aai aur maine dozakh mein jhank kar dekha to dozkhiyon mein kasarat aurton ki nazar aaii.''"
"3242","ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas baithey huey they, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke maine khuwab mein jannat dekhi, maine usmein aik aurat ko dekha jo aik mahal ke kinarey wuzu kar rahi thi. maine puchha ke ye mahal kis ka hai? to farishton ne bataya ke ye umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ka mahal hai. mujhey unki ghairat yad aai aur main wahan se fauran lot aaya. ye sun kar umr (Raziallahu anhu) ro diye aur kehney lagey : ya Rasulullah ! kya main aap ke sath bhi ghairat karoonga?"
"3243","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''(jannatiyon ka ( khema kya hai, aik moti hai khauldaar jiski bulandi uper ko tees mail tak hai. uske har kinarey par momin ki aik biwi hogi jisey doosrey na dekh sakengey.'' Abu-Abdus-Samad aur Haaris-bin-Ubaid ne abu-Imran se (bajaaey tees mail ke) sath mail bayan kya."
"3244","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala ka irshad hai ke maine apne nek bandon ke liye wo cheezein taiyaar kar rakhi hain, jinhein na aankhon ne dekha, na kanon ne suna aur na kisi insan ke dil mein unka kabhi khayal guzra hai. agar ji chahey to ye aayat padh lo فلا تعلم نفس ما أخفي لهم من قرة أعين ''to koi shakhs nahi janta ke uski aankhon ki thandak ke liye kya-kyaa cheezein chipa kar rakhi gaee hain.''"
"3245","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jannat mein dakhil hone-waale sabse pahley giroh ke chehrey aisey roshan hongey jaisey chaudahween ka chaand roshan hota hai. na usmein thookengey na unki naak se koi aalaaish aaeygii aur na peshaab, pakhana karengey. unke bartan soney ke hongey. kanghey soney chandi ke hongey. angeethiyon ka iindhan uod ka hoga. paseena mashk jaisa khushbu daar hoga aur har shakhs ki 2 beeviyan hongii. jinka Husn aisa hoga ke pindliyon ka goodaa gosht ke uper se dikhai dega. na jannatiyon mein aapas mein koi ikhtilaf hoga aur na bughz w dushmanii, unke dil aik hongey aur wo subah w Sham Allah paak ki tasbeeh w tahleel mein mashghool raha karengey.''"
"3246","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jannat mein dakhil hone-waale sabse pahley giroh ke chehrey aisey roshan hongey jaisey chaudahween ka chaand hota hai. jo giroh iske baad dakhil hoga unke chehrey sabse zyada chamakdaar sitaarey jaisey roshan hongey. unke dil aik hongey ke koi bhi ikhtilaf unmein aapas mein na hoga aur na aik doosrey se bughz w hasad hoga. har shakhs ki 2 beeviyan hongii, unki khoobsoortii aisi hogi ke unki pindliyon ka goodaa gosht ke uper se dikhai dega. wo subah w Sham Allah ki tasbeeh kartey rahengey na unko koi bimari hogi, na unki naak mein koi aalaaish aaeygii aur na thook aayega. unke bartan soney aur chandi ke aur kanghey soney ke hongey aur unki angeethiyon ka iindhan ( ألوة (ka hoga, abul-Yamaan ne bayan kya ke) ألوة ( se uod hindii murad hai. aur unka paseena mashk jaisa hoga. Mujahid ne kaha ke) إبكار ( se murad awwal fajr hai. aur) العشي ( se murad suraj ka itna dhal jana ke wo ghurub hota nazar aaney lagey."
"3247","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''meri ummat mein se 70 hazaar ya (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye farmaya ke) saat (7) laakh ki aik jamat jannat mein aik hi waqt mein dakhil hongi aur un sab ke chehrey aisey chamkeingey jaisey chaudahween ka chaand chamaktaa hai.''"
"3248","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein sundus (eik khas qism ka resham) ka aik jubba tohfe mein pesh kya gaya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (mardon ke liye) resham ke istemal se pahley hi mana farma chukey they. logon ne us jubbey ko bahut hi pasand kya, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jannat mein Sad-bin-Muaz ke roomaal us se behtar hongey."
"3249","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein resham ka aik kapda pesh kya gaya uski khoobsoortii aur nazaakat ne logon ko hairat mein daal diya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jannat mein Sad-bin-Muaz ke roomaal is se behtar aur afzal hain."
"3250","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jannat mein aik kode ki jagah duniya se aur jo kuchh duniya mein hai, sabse behtar hai.''"
"3251","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jannat mein aik darakht hai jiske saaey mein aik sawar 100 saal tak chal sakta hai aur phir bhi usko tay na kar sakega.''"
"3253","aur kisi shakhs ke liye aik kamaan ke barabar jannat mein jagah is poori duniya se behtar hai jis par suraj tuloo aur ghurub hota hai."
"3254","sabse pahlaa giroh jo jannat mein dakhil hoga, unke chehrey chaudahween raat ke chaand ki tarah roshan hongey. jo giroh iske baad dakhil hoga unke chehrey aasman par motii ki tarah chamakney waley sitaron mein jo sabse zyada roshan sitaara hota hai us jaisey roshan hongey, sab ke dil aik jaisey hongey na unmein bughz w fasaad hoga aur na hasad, har jannati ki 2 hoore-ain-beeviyaan hongii, itni Husain ke unki pindlii ki haddi aur gosht ke andar ka goodaa bhi dekha ja sakega."
"3255","jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke (saahibzaadey) Ibrahim (Raziallahu anhu) ka intiqal hua, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jannat mein usey aik doodh pilaaney wali aaya ke hawale kar diya gaya hai (jo unko doodh pilaatii hai)."
"3256","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' jannati log apne se buland kamrey walon ko uper isi tarah dekhengey jaisey chamaktey sitaarey ko jo subah ke waqt reh gaya ho, aasman ke kinarey poorab ya pachchim mein dekhtey hain. unmein aik doosrey se afzal hoga.'' logon ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah! ye to anbiya ke mahal hongey jinhein unke sawar aur koi na pa sakega. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi, us zaat ki qasam! jiske hath mein meri jaan hai. ye un logon ke liye hongey jo Allah Taala par eman laey aur anbiya ki tasdeeq ki."
"3257","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jannat ke aath (8) darwazey hain. unmein aik darwazey ka naam Rayyaan hai. jisse dakhil hone-waale sirf rozey daar hongey.''"
"3258","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik safar mein they (jab Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) Zohar ki azan dene uthey to (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke waqt zara thanda ho leney do, phir dobara (jab wo azan ke liye uthey to phir) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein yahi hukm diya ke waqt aur thanda ho leney do, yahan tak ke teelon ke nichey se saaya dhal gaya, iske baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Namaz thandey waqt oqaat mein padha karo, kyonke garmi ki shiddat jahannam ki bhap se paida hoti hai."
"3259","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' Namaz thandey waqt mein padha karo, kyonke garmi ki shiddat jahannam ki bhap se paida hoti hai.''"
"3260","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jahannam ne apne rab ke huzoor mein shikayat ki aur kaha ke mere rab! mere hi kuchh hissey ne kuchh ko kha liya hai. Allah Taala ne usey 2 saanson ki ijazat di, aik saans jaadey main aur aik garmi mein. tum intihai garmi aur intihai sardi jo in mausamon mein dekhtey ho, uska yahi sabab hai.''"
"3261","main Makka mein Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein betha karta tha. wahan mujhey bukhar aaney laga. Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke is bukhar ko zamzam ke pani se thanda kar, kyonke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jahannam ki bhap ke asar se aata hai, isliye usey pani se thanda kar liya karo ya ye farmaya ke zamzam ke pani se. ye shak Hammam rawi ko hua hai."
"3262","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke bukhar jahannam ke josh maarney ke asar se hota hai is liye usey pani se thanda kar liya karo."
"3263","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' bukhar jahannam ki bhap ke asar se hota hai usey pani se thanda kar liya karo.''"
"3264","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' bukhar jahannam ki bhap ke asar se hota hai is liye usey pani se thanda kar liya karo.''"
"3265","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' tumhari ( duniya ki) aag jahannam ki aag ke muqaabley mein (apni garmi aur halaakat khezii mein) sattarwaan hissey hai.'' kisi ne poochha, ya Rasulullah ! (kuffaar aur gunahgaaron ke azab ke liye) ye hamari duniya ki aag bhi bahut thi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' duniya ki aag ke muqaabley mein jahannam ki aag unhattar guna badh kar hai.''"
"3266","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko member par is tarah aayat padhtey sunaa ونادوا ya مالك (aur wo dozakhi pukaarengey, aey Maalik!)."
"3267","Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) se kisi ne kaha ke agar aap falan sahib (Usman (Raziallahu anhu)) ke yahan ja kar unse guftgu karo to achchha hai) taake wo ye fasaad dabaaney ki tadbeer karein ( unhon-ne kaha kya tum log ye samajhtey ho ke main unse tum ko suna kar) tumharey samney hi ( baat karta hun, main tanhai mein unse guftgu karta hun is tarah ke fasaad ka darwaza nahi kholtaa, main ye bhi nahi chahta ke sabse pahley main fasaad ka darwaza kholun aur main Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aik hadis sunney ke baad ye bhi nahi kehta ke jo shakhs mere uper sardaar ho wo sab logon mein behtar hai. logon ne puchha ke aap ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se jo hadis suni hai wo kya hai? Usama (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko maine ye farmatey suna tha ke qiyamat ke din aik shakhs ko laya jaeyga aur jahannam mein daal diya jaeyga aag mein uski aantein bahar nikal aaeingii aur wo shakhs is tarah chakkar lagaaney lagega jaisey gadhaa apni chakkii par chakkar lagaya karta hai. jahannam mein daley janey waley uske qareeb aa kar jama ho jaeinge aur us se kahengey, aey fulaan! aaj ye tumhari kya haalat hai? kya tum hamein achchhey kaam karne ke liye nahi kehtey they, aur kya tum burey kaamon se hamein mana nahi kya kartey they? wo shakhs kahega ji haan, main tumhen to achchhey kaamon ka hukm deta tha lekin khud nahi karta tha. burey kaamon se tumhen mana bhi karta tha, lekin main usey khud kya karta tha. is hadis ko ghandar ne bhi Shoba se, unhon-ne Aamash se riwayat kya hai."
"3268","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par (jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Hudaibiya se lautey they) jaadoo hua tha aur Lais-bin-Sad ne bayan kya ke mujhey Hisham ne likha tha, unhon-ne apne walid se suna tha aur yad rakha tha aur unse Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya tha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par jaadoo kya gaya tha. aap ke zahan mein baat hoti thi ke falan kaam main kar raha hun halanke aap usey na kar rahe hotey. aakhir aik din aap ne dua ki phir dua ki ke Allah paak is jaadoo ka asar dafa' kare. iske baad aap ne Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se farmaya ke tumhen malum bhi hua Allah Taala ne mujhey wo tadbeer bata di hai jis mein meri shifa muqaddar hai. mere paas 2 aadmi aaey, aik to mere sar ki taraf baith gaey aur doosra paon ki taraf. phir aik ne doosrey se kaha, unhein bimari kya hai? doosrey aadmi ne jawab diya ke un par jaadoo hua hai. unhon-ne poochha, jaadoo un par kis ne kya hai? jawab diya ke labeed-bin-A'sam Yahudi ne, puchha ke wo jaadoo (tonaa) rakha kis cheez mein hai? kaha ke kanghey mein, kataan main aur khajoor ke khushk khoshey ke ghilaaf mein. poochha, aur ye cheezein hain kahan ? kaha Zarwaan kuney mein. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wahan tashrif le gaey aur wapas aaey to Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se farmaya, wahan ke khajoor ke darakht aisey hain jaisey shaitan ki khopdi. maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha, wo tonaa aap ne nikalwaayaa bhi? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi mujhey to Allah Taala ne khud shifa di aur maine usey is khayal se nahi nikalwaayaa ke kahin uski wjah se logon mein koi jhagdaa khada kar dun. iske baad wo kunwaan band kar diya gaya."
"3269","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab koi tum mein se soyaa hua hota hai, to shaitan uske sar ki guddi par teen girhein laga deta hai khub achi tarah se aur har girah par ye mantr phoonk deta hai ke abhi bahut raat baqi hai. padaa sota reh. lekin agar wo shakhs jaag kar Allah ka zikr shuru karta hai to aik girah khul jati hai. phir jab wuzu karta hai to dusri girah khul jati hai. phir jab namaze-Fajr padhta hai to teesri girah bhi khul jati hai aur subah ko khush mizaaj khush dil rehta hai. warna bad-mizaaj sust reh kar wo din guzaarta hai.''"
"3270","main haazire-khidmat tha to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney aik aisey shakhs ka zikr aaya, jo raat bhar din chadhey tak padaa sota raha ho, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye aisa shakhs hai jiske kaan ya donon kanon mein shaitan ne peshab kar diya hai."
"3271","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, jab koi shakhs apni biwi ke paas aata hai aur ye dua padta hai بسم الله اللهم جنبنا الشيطان ، Mina وجنب الشيطان ما رزقتنا ''Allaah ke naam se shuru karta hun, aey Allah ! ham se shaitan ko door rakh aur jo kuchh hamein to de ( aulad (us se bhi shaitan ko door rakh.'' phir agar unke yahan bachcha paida hota hai to shaitan usey koi nuqsan nahi pahuncha sakta."
"3273","aur Namaz suraj ke nikalney aur doobney ke waqt na padho, kyonke suraj shaitan ke sar ke ya shaitanon ke sar ke donon konon ke beech mein se nikalta hai. Abda ne kaha, main nahi janta Hisham ne shaitan ka sar kaha ya shaitanon kaa."
"3274","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''agar tum mein se Namaz padhney mein kisi shakhs ke samney se koi guzrey to usey guzarney se rokey, agar wo na rukey to phir rokey aur agar ab bhi na rukey to us se ladey wo shaitan hai.''"
"3275","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik martaba sadqa fitr ke ghalle ki hifazat par mujhey muqarrar kya, aik shakhs aaya aur donon hathon se ghalla lap bhar-bhar kar leney laga. maine usey pakad liya aur kaha ke ab main tujhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein pesh karunga. phir unhon-ne aakhir tak hadis bayan ki, us (chor) ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha ke jab tum apne bistar par soney ke liye letney lago to Aayatul-kursii padh liya karo, uski barkat se Allah Taala ki taraf se tum par aik nigahbaan muqarrar ho jaeyga aur shaitan tumharey qareeb subah tak na aa sakega. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke baat to usne sachchii kahi hai agarche wo khud jhoota hai, wo shaitan tha."
"3276","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum mein se kisi ke paas shaitan aata hai aur tumharey dil mein pahley to ye sawal paida karta hai ke falan cheez kis ne paida ki, falan cheez kis ne paida ki? aur aakhir mein baat yahan tak pahunchata hai ke khud tumharey rab ko kis ne paida kya? jab kisi shakhs ko aisa waswasa daley to Allah se panah maangnii chaahiye, shaitaanii khayal ko chhod de.''"
"3277","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab Ramazan ka mahina aata hai to jannat ke darwazey khol diye jatey hain. jahannam ke darwazey band kar diye jatey hain aur shayatin ko zanjeeron mein kas diya jata hai.''"
"3278","mujhey Saeed-bin-Jubair ne khabar di, kaha ke maine Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha ( Nauf Bakaalii kehta hai ke khizr ke paas jo Musa gaey they wo doosrey Musa they) to unhon-ne kaha ke ham se Ubai-bin-Kab ne bayan kya, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farma rahe they ke Musa (Alaihissalam) ne apne rafeeq safar (Yoosha-bin-Noon) se farmaya ke hamara khana laa, is par unhon-ne bataya ke aapko malum bhi hai jab ham ne chattaan par padao daala tha to main machhli wahin bhool gaya (aur apne sath na la saka (aur mujhey usey yad rakhney se sirf shaitan ne ghaafil rakha aur Musa (Alaihissalam) ne us waqt tak koi thakan mehsus nahi ki jab tak us had se na guzar liye, jahan ka Allah Taala ne hukm diya tha."
"3279","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke aap mashriq ki taraf ishara karke farma rahe they ke haan! fitna usi taraf se niklega jahan se shaitan ke sar ka kona nikalta hai."
"3280","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''raat ka andhera shuru honey par ya raat shuru honey par apne bachchon ko apne paas (ghar mein) rok lo, kyonke shayatin usi waqt phailnaa shuru kartey hain. phir jab isha ke waqt mein se aik ghadi guzar jaey to unhein chhod do (chalein phirein) phir Allah ka naam lekar apna darwaza band karo, Allah ka naam lekar apna charagh bujhaa do, pani ke bartan Allah ka naam lekar dhak do, aur doosrey bartan bhi Allah ka naam lekar dhak 2 (aur agar dhakkan na ho) to darmyan mein hi koi cheez rakh do.''"
"3281","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aetikaf mein they, to main raat ke waqt aap se mulaqat ke liye (masjid mein) aai , main Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se baatein karti rahi , phir jab wapas honey ke liye khadi hui to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi mujhey chhod aaney ke liye khadey huey. Ummul-Momenin Sayeda Safiya (Raziallahu anhu) ka makan Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) ke makan hi mein tha. usi waqt 2 Ansari sahaba (Usaid-bin-Huzair, Ubaada-bin-Basheer) guzrey. jab unhon-ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha to tez chalney lagey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya, zara thahar jao ye Safiya-binte-Huyi hain. un donon sahaba ne arz kya, Subhan-Allah : ya Rasulullah ! (kya ham bhi aap ke barey mein koi shuba kar saktey hain) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke shaitan insan ke andar khoon ki tarah daudta rehta hai. isliye mujhey dar laga ke kahin tumharey dilon mein bhi koi waswasa na daal de, ya Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( lafz ( soo ( ki jagah ( lafz ( شيئا ( farmaya, mana aik hi hain."
"3282","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein betha hua tha aur (qareeb hi) 2 aadmi aapas mein gaalii-galoch kar rahe they ke aik shakhs ka munh surkh ho gaya aur gardan ki ragein phool gain . Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mujhey aik aisa kalima malum hai ke agar ye shakhs usey padh ley to uska ghussa jata rahega. farmaayaaأعوذ بالله من الشيطان ''main panah mangta hun Allah ki shaitan se.'' to uska ghussa jata rahega. logon ne is par us se kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farma rahe hain ke tumhen shaitan se Allah ki panah maangnii chaahiye, us ne kaha, kya main koi deewaanaa hun."
"3283","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''koii shakhs jab apni biwi ke paas jaey aur ye dua padh ley. ( اللهم‏‏ جنبني الشيطان ‏‏‏‏ وجنب الشيطان ما رزقتني‏ . Mina ) ''aey Allah ! mujhey shaitan se door rakh aur jo meri aulad paida ho, usey bhi shaitan se door rakh.'' phir us sohbat se agar koi bachcha paida ho to shaitan usey koi nuqsan na pahuncha sakega aur na is par tasallut qaaim kar sakega. Shoba ne bayan kya aur ham se Aamash ne bayan kya, unse Salim ne, unse Kureb ne aur unse Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne aisi hi riwayat ki."
"3284","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik martaba Namaz padhi aur farigh honey ke baad farmaya ke shaitan mere samney aa gaya tha aur Namaz tudwaaney ki koshishein shuru kar di thin, lekin Allah Taala ne mujhey is par ghalib kar diya. phir hadis ko tafseel ke sath aakhir tak bayan kya."
"3285","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab Namaz ke liye azan di jati hai to shaitan apni peeth pher kar gooz maarta hua bhaagta hai. jab azan khatm ho jati hai to wapas aa jata hai. phir jab takbeer honey lagti hai to bhag khada hota hai aur jab takbeer khatm ho jati hai to phir wapas aa jata hai aur aadmi ke dil mein waswasey dalney lagta hai ke falan baat yad kar aur falan baat yad kar, nateeja ye hota hai ke usko ye bhi yad nahi rehta ke teen rakaat Namaz padhi thi ya char rakaat, jab ye yad na rahe to saho ke 2 sajdey kare.''"
"3286","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''shaitaan har insan ki paidaaish ke waqt apni ungli se iske pahlu mein kachokey lagata hai siwaey Esa bin Maryam (Alaihissalam) ke jab unhein wo kachokey lagaaney gaya to pardey par laga aaya tha (jiske andar bachcha rehta hai. uski rasaaii wahan tak na ho sakii, Allah ne Esa (Alaihissalam) ko uski us harkat se mehfooz rakhaa).''"
"3287","main Sham (Syria) pahuncha to logon ne kaha, abu-Darda aaey unhon-ne kaha, kya tum logon mein wo shakhs hai jis ko Allah Taala ne apne rasool ki zaban par (yani aap ke zamaney se) shaitan se bacha rakha hai. ham se Sulaimaan-bin-Harab ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Shoba ne bayan kya aur unse Mughira ne yahi hadis, usmein ye hai, jinhein Allah Taala ne apne Nabi ki zabani shaitan se apni panah mein leney ka elaan kya tha, aap ki murad Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) se thi."
"3288","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Farishtey badal mein aapas mein kisi baat mein jo zameen mein honey wala hota hai baatein kartey hain. ( عنان ( se murad badal hai. to shayatin usmein se koi aik kalima sun letey hain aur wahi kaahinon ke kaan mein is tarah la kar daltey hain jaisey sheeshey ka munh mila kar usmein kuchh chhodtey hain aur wo kaahin usmein so jhoot apni taraf se milaate hain."
"3289","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jamhaaii shaitan ki taraf se hai. to jab kisi ko jamhaaii aaey to jahan tak ho sakey usey rokey . kyonke jab koi ( jamaaii letey huey) '' haa-haa '' karta hai to shaitan is par hanstaa hai.''"
"3290","Uhud ki ladai mein jab mushrekeen ko shikast ho gaee to iblees ne chilla kar kaha ke aey Allah ke bando! (yani musalmaano) apne peechhey walon se bacho, chunanche aagey ke musalman peechhey ki taraf pil padey aur peechhey walon ko (jo musalman hi they) unhon-ne maarna shuru kar diya. Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) ne dekha to unke walid Yamaan (Raziallahu anhu) bhi peechhey they. unhon-ne baarahaa kaha ke aey Allah ke bando! ye mere walid hain, ye mere walid hain. lekin Allah gawah hai ke logon ne jab tak unhein qatl na kar liya na chhoda . baad mein Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) ne sirf itna kaha ke khair. Allah tumhen maaf karey (ke tum ne ghalatfahamii se aik musalman ko mar daalaa) Urwa ne bayan kya ke phir Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) apne walid ke qaatilon ke liye barabar maghfirat ki dua kartey rahe. yahan tak ke Allah se ja miley."
"3291","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Namaz mein idhar-udhar dekhney ke mutaalliq puchha to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye shaitan ki aik uchak hai jo wo tum mein se aik ki Namaz se kuchh uchak leta hai."
"3292","mujh se Yahya-bin-abi-Kasir ne bayan kya, kaha ke mujh se Abdullah-bin-Ubai Qatada ne bayan kya aur unse unke walid ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' achchha khuwab Allah Taala ki taraf se hai aur bura khuwab shaitan ki taraf se hai. isliye agar koi bura aur daraawna khuwab dekhey to baain taraf thoo-thoo karke shaitan ke shar se Allah ki panah maangey . is amal se shaitan usey koi nuqsan na pahuncha sakega.''"
"3293","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo shakhs din bhar mein so martaba ye dua padhega لا إله إلا الله وحده لا شريك له ، Mina له الملك ، Mina وله الحمد ، Mina وهو على كل شىء قدير''nahin hai koi maabood , siwa Allah Taala ke , iska koi Sharik nahi, mulk usi ka hai. aur tamam tareef usi ke liye hai aur wo har cheez par qaadir hai.'' to usey das ghulam aazad karne ke barabar sawab milega. so nekiyan uske naamaae-aa'maal mein likhi jaeyngi aur so buraaiyaan us se mitaa di jaeyngi . us roz din bhar ye dua shaitan se uski hifazat karti rahegi . yahan tak ke Sham ho jaey aur koi shakhs us se behtar amal lekar na aayega , magar jo us se bhi zyada ye kalima padh ley."
"3294","aik baar umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir honey ki ijazat chahi . us waqt chand qureshi auratein ( khud aap ki beeviyan (aap ke paas baithi aap se guftgu kar rahi thin aur aap se (kharch mein) badhaney ka sawal kar rahi thin. khub awaz buland karke . lekin junhii umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne ijazat chaahii, wo khawaateen jaldi se pardey ke peechhey chali gain . phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein ijazat di, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) muskuraa rahe they. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, Allah Taala hamesha aapko hansaataa rakhey . ya Rasulullah ! aap ne farmaya ke mujhey un aurton par tajjub hua abhi abhii mere paas thin, lekin jab tumhari awaz suni to pardey ke peechhey jaldi se bhag gain . umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya, lekin aap ya Rasulullah ! zyada iske mustahiq they ke aap se ye darteen , phir unhon-ne kaha : aey apni jaanon ke dushmanon ! mujh se to tum dartii ho aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se nahi darteen. paak beeviyan boliin ke waqia yahi hai kyonke aap Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke bar-khilaf mizaaj mein bahut sakht hain. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''us zaat ki qism ! jiske hath mein meri jaan hai, agar shaitan bhi kahin rastey main tum se mil jaey, to jhat wo rasta chhod kar doosra rasta ikhtiyar kar leta hai.''"
"3295","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' jab koi shakhs so kar uthey aur phir wuzu karey to teen martaba naak jhaadey , kyonke shaitan raat bhar uski naak ke nathney par betha rehta hai (jis se aadmi par sustii ghalib aa jati hai. to naak jhadney se wo sustii door ho jaaeygii).''"
"3296","unse Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, main dekhta hun ke tum ko jangal mein reh kar bakriyan charaanaa bahut pasand hai. isliye jab kabhi apni bakriyon ke sath tum kisi biyaabaan mein maujood ho aur) waqt honey par) Namaz ke liye azan do to azan detey huey apni awaz khub buland karo, kyonke muazzan ki awaz azan ko jahan tak bhi koi insaan, jin ya koi cheez bhi sunegii to qiyamat ke din uske liye gawahi degi. abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ye hadis maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suni thi."
"3298","aik martaba mein aik sanp ko maarney ki koshish kar raha tha ke mujh se abu-Lubaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne pukar kar kaha ke usey na maaro , maine kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne to saanpon ke maarney ka hukm diya tha. unhon-ne bataya ke baad mein phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne gharon mein rehney waley saanpon ko jo jin hotey hain achcha mar dalney se mana farmaayaa."
"3299","mujh ko abu-Lubaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne dekha ya mere chacha Zaid-bin-Khattaab ne aur Mamar ke sath us hadis ko Yunus aur ibne-Uena aur Ishaq kalbi aur Zubeda ne bhi Zohri se riwayat kya aur Saleh aur Salim se, unhon-ne ibne-abi Hafsa aur ibne- majma' ne bhi Zohri se unhon-ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se usmein yun hai ke mujh ko abu-Lubaba aur Zaid bin-Khattab ( donon ( ne dekha."
"3300","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''eik zamana aayega jab musalman ka sabse umda maal uski wo bakriyan hongi jinhein wo pahaad ki chotiyon aur barish ki wadiyon mein lekar chala jaeyga taake is tarah apne Deen w eman ko fitnon se bacha ley.''"
"3301","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''kufr ki choti mashriq mein hai aur fakhr aur takabbur karna ghodey waalon, oont walon aur zameendaaron mein hota hai jo (umooman) gaaun ke rehney waley hotey hain aur bakri walon mein dil jamaii hoti hai.''"
"3302","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Yaman ki taraf apne hath se ishara kartey huey farmaya ke eman to idhar hai Yaman mein ! haan , aur qasaawat aur sakht dillii un logon mein hai jo oonton ki poonchhein pakdey chalaatey rahtey hain. jahan se shaitan ki chotiyaan namudaar hongii, yani Rabee' aur Muzar ki qaumon mein."
"3303","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab murgh ki baang suno to Allah se uske Fazal ka sawal kya karo, kyonke us ne Farishtey ko dekha hai aur jab gadhey ki awaz suno to shaitan se Allah ki panah maango kyonke us ne shaitan ko dekha hai.''"
"3304","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' jab raat ka andhera shuru ho ya (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye farmaya ke) jab Sham ho jaey to apne bachchon ko apne paas rok liya karo, kyonke shayatin usi waqt phailtey hain. albatta jab aik ghadi raat guzar jaey to unhein chhod do, aur Allah ka naam lekar darwazey band kar lo, kyonkey shaitan kisi band darwazey ko nahi khol sakta, ibne-Juraij ne bayan kya ke mujhey Amr-bin-Dinar ne khabar di ke unhon-ne Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se bilkul isi tarah hadis suni thi jis tarah mujhey Ata ne khabar di thi, albatta unhon-ne iska zikr nahi kya ke ''Allah ka naam lo.''"
"3305","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''banii-Israaeel mein kuchh log ghayab ho gaey. (unki sooratein maskh ho gaiin) mera to ye khayal hai ke unhein choohey ki sura mein maskh kar diya gaya. kyonke choohon ke samney jab oont ka doodh rakha jata hai to wo usey nahi peetey (kyonke Bani-Israeel ke Deen mein oont ka gosht haram tha) aur agar bakri ka doodh rakha jaey to pi jatey hain. phir maine ye hadis Kab ahbaar se bayan ki to unhon-ne (hairat se) poochha, kya waqei aap ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ye hadis suni hai? kai martaba unhon-ne ye sawal kya. is par maine kaha (ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se nahi suni to phir kis se) kya main Taurah padha karta hoon? (ke us se naql karke bayan karta hoon)."
"3306","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne girgit ke mutaalliq farmaya ke wo moozii janwar hai lekin maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usey mar dalney ka hukm nahi suna tha aur Sad-bin-abi-Waqas bataatey they ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey mar dalney ka hukm farmaya hai."
"3307","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne girgit ko mar dalney ka hukm farmaya hai."
"3308","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jis sanp ke sar par 2 nuqtey hotey hain, unhein mar daala karo, kyonke wo andha bana detey hain aur hamal ko bhi nuqsan pahunchaatey hain.''abu-Usaama ke sath isko Hammaad-bin-Salma ne bhi riwayat kya."
"3309","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dum-katey sanp ko mar dalney ka hukm diya aur farmaya ke ye aankhon ko nuqsan pahunchata hai aur hamal ko saaqit kar deta hai."
"3311","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''patley ya safaid saanpon ko na maara karo. albatta dam katey huey sanp ko jis par 2 safaid dhaariyaan hoti hain usko mar daalo, kyonke ye itna zahreela hai ke haamla ke hamal ko gira deta hai aur aadmi ko andha bana deta hai.''"
"3313","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne gharon ke patley ya safaid saanpon ko maarney se mana farmaya hai to unhon-ne maarna chhod diya."
"3314","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''paanch janwar moozii hain, unhein haram mein bhi maara ja sakta hai choohaa , bichho , cheel , kowa aur kaat leney wala kuttaa.''"
"3315","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' panch janwar aisey hain jinhein agar koi shakhs haalate-ehraam mein bhi mar daley to is par koi gunah nahi. bichho, choohaa, kaat leney wala kuttaa, kowa aur cheel.''"
"3316","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''paanii ke bartanon ko dhak liya karo, mishkezon (ke munh) ko baandh liya karo, darwazey band kar liya karo aur apne bachchon ko apne paas jama kar liya karo, kyonke Sham (Syria) hotey hi Jinnaat (poorii zameen par) phailtey hain aur uchaktey phirtey hain aur sotey waqt charagh bujhaa liya karo, kyonke moozii janwar ( choohaa ( kabhii-kabhii jaltii battii ko kheench laataa hai aur is tarah sarey ghar ko jalaa deta hai.'' ibne-Juraij aur Habib ne bhi usko Ata se riwayat kya, usmein Jinnon ke badal shayatin mazkoor hain."
"3317","( maqam Mina mein) ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aik ghaar mein baithey huey they ke aayat (Mursalaate-Urfaa) nazil hui, abhi ham aap ki zaban Mubarak se usey sun hi rahe they ke aik bil mein se aik sanp niklaa. ham usey maarney ke liye jhaptey, lekin wo bhag gaya aur apne bil mein dakhil ho gaya, (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne) is par farmaya ''tumhaarey hath se wo isi tarah bach nikla jaisey tum uske shar se bach gaey'' aur Yahya ne Israel se riwayat kya hai, unse Aamash ne, unse Ibrahim ne, unse Alqama ne aur unse Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne isi tarah riwayat kya aur kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zaban Mubarak se is sura ko taaza-taaza sun rahe they aur Israel ke sath is hadis ko abu-Awana ne Mughira se riwayat kya aur Hafs-bin-Ghiyaas aur abu-Muawia aur Sulaiman bin-Qaram ne bhi Aamash se bayan kya, unse Ibrahim ne, unse Aswad ne aur unse Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne."
"3318","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bayan kya ''eik aurat aik billi ke sabab se dozakh mein gaee, us ne billi ko baandh kar rakha na to usey khana diya aur na hi chhoda ke wo keedey makodey kha kar apni jaan bacha letii.'' Abdul-Aala ne kaha aur ham se Ubaidullah ne bayan kya, unse Saeed Maqbari ne aur unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se isi tarah riwayat kya."
"3319","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''garohe-anbiyaa mein se aik Nabi aik darakht ke saaey mein utrey, wahan unhein kisi aik chewntii ne kaat liya. to unhon-ne hukm diya, unka Sara saman darakht ke taley se utha liya gaya. phir chewntiyon ka Sara chhatta jalwaa diya. is par Allah Taala ne un par wahi bheji ke tum ko to aik hi chewntii ne kaataa tha, faqat usi ko jalaanaa tha.''"
"3320","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab makkhii kisi ke peeney (ya khaney ki cheez ( mein pad jaey to usey dubo de aur phir nikal kar phenk de. kyonke iske aik par main bimari hai aur uske doosrey ( par) mein shifa hoti hai.''"
"3321","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''eik faahisha aurat sirf is wjah se bakhshii gaee ke wo aik kuttey ke qareeb se guzar rahi thi, jo aik kuwein ke qareeb khada piyaasaa haanp raha tha. aisa malum hota tha ke wo piyaas ki shiddat se abhi mar jaeyga us aurat ne apna moza nikala aur is mein apna dupatta baandh kar pani nikala aur us kuttey ko pilaa diya, to uski bakhshish usi ( neki ( ki wjah se ho gaii.''"
"3322","mujh ko koi shak hi nahi, jaisey ismein shak nahi ke to is jagah maujood hai. ( unhon-ne bayan kya ke) mujhey Ubaidullah ne khabar di, unhein Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne aur unhein abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' ( rehmat ke) Farishtey un gharon mein nahi dakhil hotey jin mein kutta ya ( jaandaar ki) tasweer ho.''"
"3323","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kutton ko maarney ka hukm farmaya hai."
"3324","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo shakhs kutta paaley, uske amale-nek mein se rozaana aik qirat (sawab) kam kar diya jata hai, khet ke liye ya maweshii ke liye jo kuttey paaley jayen wo us se alag hain.''"
"3325","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jisne koi kutta paalaa, na to paalne waley ka maqsad khet ki hifazat hai aur na maweshiyon ki, to rozaana uske nek amal mein se aik qirat (sawaab) ki kami ho jati hai.'' Saaib ne poochha, kya tum ne khud ye hadis Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suni thi? unhon-ne kaha, haan ! is qible ke rab ki qism ( maine khud is hadis ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai)."